<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">;- HUNGWARHEA Markus</book>
  <para style="h1">Markus</para>
  <para style="toc1">markus</para>
  <para style="toc2">markus</para>
  <para style="toc3">markus</para>
  <para style="mt">Buna bu rubuci u takada labari u laco iziya i buba isa Markus Yohana</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Icibagu i Yohana u baptisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Cikarigo cini cisa ci burya̠ ci Yesu Kristi, Bwa bu Hwinsu.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Cikarigo cini ci rwagu nga̠ bucibago Hwinsu Ishaya uba hilange: &lt;&lt;Hwinsu u hin, &lt;Ni cuma bucuma nimui gaba ni goo<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />&lt;&lt;Buco bu yiwa ni oge ni hila̠ na zwamgana, &lt;Kimganji Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu yina, a kimga hayina ha Hwinsu.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yohana i kurya̠, ne ia̠gya aco cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu baptisma ni zwamgana ana aco a curi ia̠gu eewo zwama Hwinsu ui curgagya ga magwata̠ maba. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Aco dinyiya na yiwa na usala u Yahudiya na i'ogo Urshalima a kore pa Yohana zwama a ia̠gi ga baptisma. Aba na zwamgana Yohana magwata̱ yaba, bware hinda bu ia̠gi ga baptisma na uwo u Yodan. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Cilapo ci Yohana a ia̠gi ca na utaka̠ urakumi, buma pare abe na utaka̠, hinda mare ma bware hagyasa na ciswinya. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Hinda bware bu zwama aco: &lt;&lt;Buco buna bu yiwa ni kuro kacuta akamui buna zake ni kuce na panuwa i kuki pasingi birigi bi hataka ha buba. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Gya ni yiwa na ia̠gya ga baptistma na miya ama bware bui ia̠gya baptisma na a̠huru a burya̠ a Hwinsu.<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana u ia̠gi Yesu baptisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Aza huna Yesu iba i sirya Nazaret ana a yiwa u sala u Galili zwam Yohana a ia̠gya bware baptisma na u jaba u Yodan. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Nga̠ Yesu iba hina sirya na miya bware bu hyan zaro u ma gonje hinda a̠huru a Hwinsu a kanzigi zata icwa i buba i nyaga nga̠ itarkagu. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Kwa aba ni hoge cikarigo ni zaro: &lt;&lt;Busa Bwa abumui, buna bu gya ni ka̠ri, na goo gya ni hugi laco.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Ai sanuwo kwa a̠huru a Hwinsu ni zangi bware kurwa i hila̠, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />ihugo ina Yesu iba madale muhun kupe nasi na hila, ahwaya buco bu eewo buba gwaji Yesu. Bu yanse buba ni mukwacukwacu, mu hila̠, na acuma a Hwinsu aba ciyabu pa bware.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">silmajiri si nasi si jigo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Nga̠ aba tane Yohana ni ukaba u ci'incu, Yesu a kure Galili ne ia̠ga aco cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />&lt;&lt;Hun kurya&gt;&gt; Yesu i hin. &lt;&lt;Cigwama ci Hwinsu ci yabtano. Curyaje eewo i yaje cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Aza hun na Yesu uba ni jabaga ni ugagi u uwo u Galili, bware bu hyan Saminu ni buhun bu bware Andarawus aba ni kwama taru i kumbago murage ni uwo, zwama asa aco kumbagu murege. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />&lt;&lt;Kuryaje, ni lagana,&gt;&gt; Yesu i hin, &lt;&lt;Ni san aco a kumbagu murege.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />I sanuwo kwa aba ni curya iyi kumbagu murege kwa ni lagan Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Nga̠ Yesu bu madanjigan cimu kwa bware ni hyan Yakub bwa bu Zabadi ni buhun bu bware Yohana ni suwa u jirgi u miya, aba ni kimgana iyi kumbagu murege. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Nga̠ Yesu iba hyan ga, kwa bware ni uga ga; Kwa aba ni curya buca buba Zabadi ni suwo u jirgi u miya, kwa ni curya Zabadi ni aco ni yiwa na ia̠gya ga ibwana kwa ni lagan Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i ace mupyala mu eewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu na silmajiri saba a kure pa i'ogo ina aba uga Kaparnahun, nga̠ hun ihupacu i Hayahudawa uba wa kure, Yesu kwa ni ise yaba i ahunda a Hayahudawa nga̠ iba ni cibaga ga cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Cigwama ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Aco hoge mamaki dinyiya na cibagu i Yesu, zwama bware bu cibagiga nga̠ buco buna buza koce, icibagu bware i nyaganuwa ni icibagu i hawalami ha icibagu i cikarigo ci Musa. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />I sanuwo buco buna buzi mupyala mu eewo ni isa Iginga i a̠hunda a Hayahudawa buba ni cu'ogo na koce, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />&lt;&lt;Biya goo bu gimbago ni gaci, Yesu i Nazaret? bu kurwa ni ci hunaga? Ni bu daki ka̠mu busa- buco bu nagu ciri Bwa bu Hwinsu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />kwa Yesu na butana mupyala mu eewo,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;uwatana!.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;sirya ni soo u bware!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Kwa mupyala mu eewo ni jungutanu buco buni ni koce kwa ni sire ni koce.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Aco hugi mamaki dinyiya kwa aba ni mazwaman, &lt;&lt;biya? isa icibago i pun-hinda ni koce! bware bu iyi cikarigo ni mupyala mu eewo hinda muba laga cikarigo ci bo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Wa sanuwo cikarigiwo ci Yesu ci hogi ange ni usala u Galili.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i hwingacume aco mahuna dinyiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Wa sanuwo Yesu ni silmajiri si bware tare ni Yakub ni Yohana, aba ni curya yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa i ahunda̠ a Hayahudawa ai yisaniwa huga hya kwa yaba Saminu ni Andarawus. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Kwasigo a Saminu i huguwa laco, kwa ni zwaman Yesu nagu u lapiya wui ba. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Kwa Yesu ni kure hu kwasigo u Saminu, kwa bware ni kumbe wa u buba kwa ni yasinga bob. zazabi kwa ni curya bob kwa buba ni masiga ni ia̠gyaga mare.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Inga uyumbi uba iyi aco a kulage Yesu aco mahuna na aco mahuna ma mupyala mu eewo. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Aco i'ogo kanmu matanaga ni i'iba, <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />kwa Yesu ni hwingacuma aco dinyiya ana aza ti'iri mamba mahuna. Bware bu silacume mupyala mu eewo dinyiya, ama bu gazga mupyala ni ia̠g cikarigo zwam mu daki bware.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu i iyi ahunda̠ pa ihuga ina iza buca̠hya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Nubungo ma'inta kwa ihug i si'inci, Yesu i masigaye, kwa ni kure ihuga ina iza buca̠hya, ahwayi bware buba iyi ahunda. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Kwa Saminu ni a'usa a ibwana i bware a kure ni gimba u bware, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Ng aba hyan Yesu! kwa ni hin ni bware: &lt;&lt;Aco ka̠mu na i'ogo a yiwa ni gimbo nibui!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Ama Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Ci mu kureja si hila si mewa sina si yabta nga̠ gya ni zwamani ga cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu. Ina sa gya ni kuri bini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Yesu a a̠nge i'ogo i Galili ka̠mu, buba ni zwamganag cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu ni muginga mu ahunda̠ a Hayahudawa hinda buba ni handgaga aco ni mupyala mu eewo.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a Hwingwcume Buco Bu mahuna Ma Cikuturu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Buco bu mahuna ma cikuturu bu kure pa Yesu kwa ni kuztan na une bware, &lt;&lt;Si bu yaje, ni guzagi ni ringiya buco bu nagu ciri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Kwa Yesu ni hoge yama buco bu mahuna ma cikuturu, kwa ni cutan wa kwa ni danga bwa. &lt;&lt;Ni yaji,&gt;&gt; Yesu i hin. &lt;&lt;Ma guzagi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Ai sanuwo kwa mahuna ma cikuturu ni curya̠ bo.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Ai sanuwo kwa Yesu ni hin ni buba bu ali Yesu kwa ni numi buba hacube: <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />&lt;&lt;Kula ta zwamana bucohya. ama ala, ma cibe icwa nubui pa bulabe bu yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa hinda pa sadaka una u Musa uba hin usa iguzagu i ciri, hinda usi sheda pa aco.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ama nga̠ buco bu mahuna ma cikuturu buba sire kwa buba ni hinan zwamagan aco, ka̠mu ini hin bo. Ina sa bini, Yesu iba i panuwa isakana i'ogo hya kwa ni ciswin ama kwa di bu yisa ni japu ni huga ini iza aco. Ka̠mu ni haruni aco hina ni kulage pa bware tuhunba.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu a Hwingwcume Buco bu Mahun ma Amaci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Nga̠ mohun cimu muba aliyi Yesu i gupa kore Kaparnahun, kwa aba na daki bware bu yiwa na yaba. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Aco matanaga dinyiya hal ukaba uza, ka̠mu na ijapu pa i'iba,Yesu i ia̠gi ga cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Kwa aco nasi, na kolage yesu buco bu mahuna ma amaci. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Nga̠ unu burya̠. aba mayage na kole buco bu mahuna pa Yesu zwama upugo, kwa aba ne yidana zata ui ishima kwa na pusi zata na Yesu, kwa aba na zubale bo pa Yesu na cibaro cina aba labute bo. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Nga̠ Yesu aba hyan i tano i soo waba, kwa Yesu na hin na buco bu mahuna ma amaci, &lt;&lt;Bwa a bumui, Hwinsu u yape magwata̱ a mabui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Na huni hacagiya hawalami hai icibago i musa ha yanse, ha mazwama na soo waba, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />&lt;&lt;Bai san buco buna buba zwame haruni? Bu yagage Hwinsu! Ganba bu pwan i yape magwata̱ ma wuma kwa di Hwinsu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Ai sanuwo Yesu i daki ka̠mu na soo iba ina na hasoo haba, kwa iba ne hin naba, &lt;&lt;Bai san ga̠hi iyiwa na wugi ini? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Bai zake na sauki: an hin na buco bu mahuna ma amaci, &lt;A yape magwata̱ amabui,&gt; ko hinda an hin, &lt;Masinge&gt; zanga cibaro acibui jabage&gt;? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Ama zwama ga̠hi daki an Bwa bu Buwama buza koce na doone u buba bui yape magwata̱ ma aco.&gt;&gt; Kwa Yesu na hin na buco bu mahuna ma amaci, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />&lt;&lt;Na bu zwama, masinge, zangaca cibaro acibui aliyi giwo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Bu masinge kwa na zangaca cibaro ci buba kwa na ala aba na mogengo mu buba ka̠mu. ini i pan ga mamaki kwa aba na pwa̠n Hwinsu cilabe, aba na zwamaga, &lt;&lt;Ci si tabuwa hyan i haruna!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a uga Lawi</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu i gope sere na ugagi uwo. Aco na matanaga dinyiya a korya̠ pa Bware, kwa Bware na hinana icibaga ga. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Yesu iba na jabaga, kwa iba na hyan Lawi bwa bo Halfa, ihuga ina aba cago ganju. kwa Yesu na hin na buba &lt;&lt;Na laganya,&gt;&gt; Lawi a masenge kwa na lagana Bware. <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Na yunbe hun na Lawi aba hyan na Yesu a kurya a re mare ma gita na yaba bware, aco icago i gandju dinya na &lt;&lt;Aco magwata̱ &lt;&lt;Aba na re mare na bware na silmajiri si Yesu, zwama aco yanse dinya an laga bware. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Nga̠ hawalami hai icibago i Musa ana asa Haparisiyawa aba hyan bware buba na re mare na &lt;&lt;Aco magwata̱&gt;&gt; na acago gandju, kwa aba na kabana silmajiri si Yesu: &lt;&lt;Be san bware buba yiwa na re mare na aco icago i gandju &lt;Aco magwata̠&gt;?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Nga̠ Yesu aba hugi haruni, i hin naba, &lt;&lt;Aco na aza mahuna aza ginbo buco bu byaco, ama aco mahuna abiya a gimbo buco bu byaco. Ne kurya ginbo aco nagu magwata̱, ama aco magwata̠&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aco ia̠gi Yesu makaba̠ ma cu'oin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Baniya silmajiri si Yohana na Haparisiyawa ha ia̠gu cu'oin. Kwa acagiya na korya na kabana Yesu, &lt;&lt;Bai san silmajiri si Yohana na Haparisiyawa a ia̠gu cu'oin, ama silmajiri asibo si ia̠go?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu i cane ga, &lt;&lt;Neya siboki ango siba si ia̠ga cu'oin aba tare?Aza ia̠ga, si di ango ayiwa na ba. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ama hun yiwa na korwa hun na aba ai zangca ango pa ba, na hun uniya ai eaga cu'oin. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />&lt;&lt;Aza buna bui yitago cilapo ci pu na azuzu na ihuga na mahanje, ikinda i pu i dance na ina igose, i hacigag uhanje. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Aza buna bui halana maro na utako u maro u gose. Sa a hala, maro mai punagi ma pusi utako, na maro na utako ai majiga na cinge. Aye, ai halana na utako upu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabo ma hun ihupacu i Hayahudawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Aza hun ihupacu i Hayahudawa Yesu na silmajiri si bware aba na jabaga suwa inta u alkama hun ihupacu i Hayahudawa, kwa aba ne hinana wadaga sicwa masalo aba ne re. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Kwa Haparisiyawa na hin na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Byana, bai san silmajiri asibui siba yiwa na ia̠ga ina cikarigo ci Musa ciba gazi ata ia̠ hun ihupacu i Hayahudawa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu i cane, &lt;&lt;I karantcuwa ina Dauda uba na aco na yiwa na lagana aba ia̠ nga̠ imirwa iba konbe ga? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Hon na Abiyata aba sanse bulabe bu yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa, a ese yaba Hwinsu aba re mare man aba iri Hwinsu, man bulabe bulabe bube buza giri u cire. Hinda bu pan aco na yiwa tare na bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Kwa Yesu na hin nab, &lt;&lt;Gya na sa Hwinsu u hun ihupacu i Hayahudawa zwama buwama, sa buwama zwama hun ihupacu i Hayahudawa. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Bwa bu Buwama busa Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu ka̠mu hun ihupacu i Hayahudawa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu a hwingacume buco bu mahuna ma amaci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Hun mewa na hun ihupacu i hayahudawa Yesu u ese yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa i ahunda a Hayahudawa, buco buna bo mahuna ma amaci aba kobe wa bo yase apayi. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Aza aco na a ginbage a konbe Yesu na magwata̠, a hina ne lagana Yesu ciyabu zwama a hyan ko Yesu ui hadgaga buco bu mahuna hun ihupacu i Hayahudawa. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu in hin na buco bu mahuna ma amaci aba konbe wa, &lt;&lt;Masinge yinsa na gaba aco.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Kwa Yesu na kaban aco, &lt;&lt;Bai icibago ci Musa ciba yaje a ia̠ hun ihupacu i Hayahudawa: a ea i burya̠ ko a i eewo, a ce a̱huru ko a hune?&gt;&gt; Ama a otani ai canya. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu i byane ga na soo u bob, buba na hacigagi suwa na nagu ihogo na hasuwa, kwa buba na hin na buco bu mahuna, &lt;&lt;Danda wa nibui.&gt;&gt; Bu dande wa zata, kwa wa u buba na maringe nga̱ bui huguwa ihya. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Kwa Haparisiyawa ne sere pa ihuga i a̠hunda a Hayahudawa ne ijapu na gama sicwa na aco Hiridus ana ginbaga yina aba ai hune Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aco dinyiya a laga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu na silmajiri a curi e'ogo kwa aba na kore uwo u Galili, aco dinyiya an a sirya Galili na Yahudiya a laga bware. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Nga̱ aba hoge ka̠mu ina Yesu uba yiwa na ia̠ga, aco Yahudiya a korya pa Bware, na Urshalima, na Edom na usala ukacaso ujaba u Yodan ciyabu na Taya na Sidon. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Zwama upugu wa aco Yesu a zwama silmajiri sa Bware sa zangiya bo jirigi u noya u miya, zwama upugu wa aco uta hunmano Bware. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Yesu a ea haruni zwama bu rigyano bwa hwingacuma aco mahuna dinya, hal aco mahuna a hina na kore ciyabu na Bware zwama dangi Bware. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Tohunba aco na aza mupyala mu eewo muba hyan Yesu, muba hene pa Bware muba na sangana cu'ogo, &lt;&lt;Busa Bwa bu Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Yesu a numi mupyala mu eewo hacube a ta zwamana buciyahya ko bo sa ganba.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a tanga aco ibwan ikope na sirya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Kwa Yesu a yinda zata ui i'ogo kwa na ugan na buba ginbo, kwa aba na kore pa Bware. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Kwa Yesu na tangan aco ikope na barya-kwa bware na ogana aco ibwana bware-zwama a yan tare na Bware zwama bu hina cumagana ga izwamago cikarigo ci Hwinsu <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />hinda a hin koce aba ai silacuma mupyala mu eewo. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Muziya mu silmajiri kupe na sirya sina Yesu aba tanga: Saminu (buna Yesu aba zane Bitrus); <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakub bwa bu Zabadi na buhunwo bu bware Yohana (an bware buba zane ga haziya Buwarnajis nupi u iziya ini Bita); <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andarawus, Filibus, Bartalomi, Matiyu,Toma,Yakub bwa bu Halfa, Taddiyus, Saminu buco bu Kan'ana, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Yahuda Iskariyoti ina i cuta Yesu zwama a huni bware.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Ba'alzabul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Nga̠ Yesu aba giwo na yaba, aco hinda kwa na matanaga, hal Yesu na silmajiri si Bware ama yage na re mare. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Nga̠ a̠hun Yesu aba huge haruni, kwa aba na kore zwama a zangi bware, zwama a ali yaba aco hin, &lt;&lt;Bware tuwa apisa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Hinda hawalami ha icibago i Musa han ha sere Urshalima ha hin, &lt;&lt;Ai Ba'alzabul bugwama bu mupyala mu eewo mube mu ese na suwa u Bware! Na koce mupyala mu eewo buba yiwa silacuma ga mupyala mu eewo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Kwa Yesu na ugan hawalami ha icibago i Musa kwa na pan ga misali: &lt;&lt;Neya buco bu eewo buba bui ance bugwama bu eewo? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Sa cigwama cima habsagena icwa i siba, cugwama cini ciza i yiinsana. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Sa yaba i macyabi cirya, yaba ni iza yinsana. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Hinda sa buco bu eewo bwa yajuwa na ibwana i buba, buza i yinsana; ihogu i buba i kurwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Kamahinda, aza buna bu pwan i ese yaba buna bu hoge koce nga̠ buco bu eewo hal bu zangi izan i buba kwa di bu rwage i pare buco bu koce. kacuma buba pwan ihugana izana i yaba ni. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Kamahinda na zwama, ka̠mu buna bu eagu magwata̠ na ibwana i cwa a̠huru a Hwinsu, Hwinsu u za yape ga. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Ama buna bu cwa a̠huru a burya̠ a Hwinsu aza i yape bo; bu i magwata̠ mana maza ihogu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu a zwame haruni zwama a hoge aba na zwamaga,&lt;&lt;Bware bu za mupyala mu eewo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amaci a Yesu na hun Bware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Amaci a Yesu na hunwo bware kwa na kore pa bware kwa na yisana na ijapu, a cuma bucohya bu uganya bware. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Aco madale a riga Bware, kwa aba na hin na Bware, &lt;&lt;Amaci na bui na ahun nubui a yiwa na ginbo nibui na ijapu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Kwa Yesu na kabana ga, &lt;&lt;Ganba busa amaci numui na ahun numui?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Yesu a byane aco na madale na ringa Bware kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Amaci namu bana na ahun na mui! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Ka̠mu buna bui ina Hwinsu uba ginbo abe asa ahun nimui na amaci nimui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Misali u buco bu cikaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Nga̠ Yesu iba gope hinana icibago na uwo u Galili. Aco na matanaga pa bware a monse dinyiya hal Bware bu ese jirgi u miya kwa na yinsa na suwa uba, aco na matanaga a madale ugagi uwo uni. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Yesu bu cibage ga i dinya na misali u cikarigo, na icibago ini bu hin: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />&lt;&lt;Kublaje! Buco bu cuma bu kore i yansa i birwo. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Nga̠ buba na gatgaga birwa, icage bero i hine na yina, kwa muwono na kurya na tangaga na re. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Icagiya i hene na ihuga i haswara, ihug ina iza cinge. I puci na mabuna, zwama cinge ci isumuwo. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ama nga̠ ubwobo u hwinsu uba u hanze, kwa ina aba bere ne hunki, na padal zwama iza haganda. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Icage birwa i hine na ikware, ikware i monse kwa na izake ina aba kabe koce, hal imacuwa imata. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Icagiya biro hinda i hine na cinge ci burya̠. Ci monse, hal ci i imata, na makugana yaba kope hataco, kope cunuhi, halma korwa da̠ri uikan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Kwa Yesu na hin, &lt;&lt;Buna buza hacobe hai ihugago, bo hoge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">ma'ana ma misali u buco bu cikaba</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Nga̠ Yesu iba madale ibaiba, Silmajiri si bware ikope na sirya na cagiya aco a kaba ina i misali uni zwamage. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Kwa Yesu na hin na ba, &lt;&lt;Ciswin ci cigwama ci Hwinsu a pano. Ama aco na za na ga̠hi sa eagyi tibai na misali. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Nga̠, &lt;&lt; &lt;Aba ai byagano ama aza ihyan ihya, na hoge ama aza iganya ihya; zwama ata ganya hal a yape magwata̠ maba!&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Kwa Yesu na kaban ga, &lt;&lt;I dakuwo misali una? Naiya ga̠hi daki misali umenwa? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Buco bu cuma buna bu kabe bero cikarigo ci Hwinsu buba yiwa kabe. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Ibero na hene na yina, i nya̠ga na aco na aba ia̠gi cikarigo ci Hwinsu. Nga̠ aba hugi cikarigo ci Hwinsu, buco bu eewo bu kore bu zangaci cikarigo cina aba egyi ga. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Harbuni hinda, bero na hene na cinge cina ci za hatare, nyaga na aco na hoge cikarigo a ce na wa̱wo. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Ama nga̠ aba za ipicu na haganda, aza isana. Sa sungula u kulta ga zwama cikarigo ci Hwinsu, ai maringya kacuta. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Acagiya aco, a nyaga na bero na aba kabe na ikware a hoge cikarigo; <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ama cidama ci doone, na maka̠la̠ ma i doone hinda na malaku ma cyage a ese kwa na gasgana cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci monsa,hal ci sane ci jidanuwa ihya. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Acagiya aco, a nyaga na bero na aba kabe na cinge burya̠, a hoge cikarigo a ce ca, hal a hin riba kope hataco-hataco, kope cunuhin ko ma ina zake ina aba kabe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwatanci wa Apicila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu a hin naba hinda, &lt;&lt;Ganba bu kole apicila bu tane na soo ikwano bu kubta? Iza junka zata ihuga ina aba ilagu apicila? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Ina ka̠mu aba swin ai gunja, hinda ina gunda ai silacome a gunje na ijapu. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Kubla je Buna buza hacube hai ihugo, bu hoge.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu a gupe hin naba, &lt;&lt;masikai na ina ga̠hi hugi,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Na ikwano ina goo bu mage aco ibe, aba ibu magya- hal ma a hwatai. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Ka̠mu bu za ihya ai jidana bo, hinda buna bu za ihya koma i cimu ina buba za ai cyaga bwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali u biro ina yiwa na muso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Kwa Yesu na jidana hin, &lt;&lt;Cigwama ci Hwinsu ci nyaga harbuna. Buco bu gatagage biro na cinge. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Gita na hwinsu, ko bu labce ko bu masingai, i biro i puca na muso, bui dakuwo ina iyi. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Cinge na icwa i ciba cisa silacume imata-jigo usanga, icwa, kwa hinda icwa i silacume biro. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Sa hun imata iba yene, buco bu tana aluzi bu hwage, zwama gubo u kurwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali u biro u Mastad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu a jidana hin naba, &lt;&lt;Bai gaci ci hyan ana cigwama ci Hwinsu ci nyaga na ba, ko muba misali u ga̠ci ci pan una u nyaga na ciba? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Cigwama ci Hwinsu ci nyaga na biro bi mastad, bina bisa biro bi nuya aba kabe na cinge. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Iza i sana sa kabe bya, be musa bi sana u'o u labe na inta, bi zana cihog hana muwono mu zaro mui hupana na uhuruhuru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Na iri ha misali a hani dinyiya Yesu aba zwamage cikarigo ci Hwinsu pa aco dinyiya, nga̠ aba ai ganya. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Yesu ui ia̠guwo cikarigo hya cina ciza misali. Ama na bware buba na silmajiri si buba, kwa bware ne zwamanaga ka̠mu ina ha misali hani haba sa.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a butane mupyala mu koce na uwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Na hun na nga̠ yinbe uba i kwa Yesu na hin na silmajiri saba, &lt;&lt;Ci mu kace ukacaso uwo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />A curi ihuga ina aco dinyiya aba matanaga kwa aba na kaca na bware, nga̠ bware uba yiwa na suwa u jirgi u miya u nuya. Hajirgi ha nuya ha miya ha yanse pa bware. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />I sanuwo kwa mupyala mu apisa na masingai, hinda hal ijwaka miya ikari pusi jirgi u miya u nuya, hal miya ma ka̠ri i sinji jirgi. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Ama Yesu a zibi na imiya i jirgi, na malabo zata wui i dalo. silmajiri si zime bware kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Walami, bu ka̠ri ga̠ci kwaji na miya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Kwa Yesu a masingai, kwa bware na butana mupyala mu kuce hinda kwa na hin na ijwakwa miya, &lt;&lt;Utana! I yinsa!&gt;&gt; Kwa mupyala na labuta ka̱mu. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Kwa Yesu na hin na silmajiri saba, &lt;&lt;Bai sa ga̱hi i yiwa na huge iwasa? Izawa i tano i soo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Silmajiri si huge iwasa kwa na mazwaman, &lt;&lt;Gamba buna? Hal na mupyala na jakwa miya huge cikarigo ci buba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu i hwingacume buco bu ma apisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Kwa Yesu na silmajiri si bware a kore ukaceso uwo u Galili una u yiwa pa usala u Hagarasinawa. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Nga̠ Yesu na silmajiri aba sire na suwa u jirgi u miya, kwa buco bu mahuna ma mupyala mu eewo bu sere na suwa u hazin bu kore pa bware. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Buco buni bu yiwa na suwa u hazin, a nagi buna bui pwa̠na i pare bo, ko na kasarka. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />A sano sa pare bo buna na siwa na kasarka, busa bu makakase kasarka hinda makakase maruma na buna. A nagi buna bu za koce ina buba bui konbe bo. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Tuhun lokaci na hwinsu na gita aza buco buna bui hina i ange hazin na mu'ogo buba na sangana cu'ogo buba na makajaga ikanga na hatare. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Nga̠ buba ha̠in Yesu na cimere, kwa buba na yamana monda kwa na kuztan Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Kwa mupyala mu eewo muna mu yiwa na suwa u ikanga bware na san cu'og, &lt;&lt;Bai goo bu ginbago a hwamui, Yesu, Bwa bu Labe Hwinsu? Ni ma ga̠mi na Hwinsu ni ia̠ga alkawali buza na sungulacuma!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Mupyala mu eewo mu hin haruni zwama Yesu i hin, &lt;&lt;Sirya na soo u buco buna, go mupyala mu eewo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Kwa Yesu na hin na buba, &lt;&lt;Iziya nebo ganba?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Iziya nimui dinya,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">bu cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Zwam ci yiwa ci mose.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Kwa buco bu apisa na hinana une Yesu ata silacuma mupyala mu eewo na usala uni.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Ciyabu na ihuga ini garke u silade si yanse na ihuba̠. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Hinda mupyala mu eewo kwa na une yesu, &lt;&lt;San ci ese na suwa u silade; curi ci ese na suwa u siba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Kwa Yesu na yaje, kwa mupyala mu eewo na sirya na ese na suwa u silade. Garke u silade, si yanse dubu urya, kwa silade sini ka̠mu na ia̠man munda na mawalan na suwa uwo kwa na kwaji.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Aco yanse na huban silade sini na yamana monda kurwa e'ogo na cubagan aco ina ia̠gi silade sini. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Nga̠ aco i'ogo aba a kore pa Yesu, kwa na hyan buco bu mupyala mu eewo dinyiya buni, bu madale na hazunga na ikanga i buba; kwa iwasa na konbe ga. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Aco na aba hyan na haisa haba a cubage ina ia̠gi na buco- bu mupyala mu eewo ina ia̠gi na silade hinda. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Kwa aco i'ogo ini na une Yesu a curi usala waba.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Nga̠ buco bu mupyala mu eewo buba hyan Yesu i ginbo ese jirgi u miya i ali, kwa buba na une Yesu a curi bu laga bware. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yesu a yadwuwa, ama kwa na hin na buba, &lt;&lt;Ala giwo bangi aco nibui zwama ga ina Bugwama Hwinsu buba bu ia̠gi, nga̠ buba huge yama nibui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Kwa buco bu mupyala mu eewo na ese mu'ogo mukupe muba na zwamagan ina Yesu aba ia̠gi bo. Aco ka̠mu a hoge mamaki.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikangaza ina i kwaji na bu'a buna bu yiwa na mahuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Nga̠ Yesu na silmajiri aba gope i kaca ukacaso uwo na jirgi u miya, aco matanaga dinyiya pa bware na ugagi uwo. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Kwa alabe a yaba i ahunda̱ a Hayahudawa, iziya i buba Yayirus, na korya pa bware. Nga̠ buba hyan Yesu kwa na kuztan Yesu, na buna bware <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />bu hina i une Yesu, &lt;&lt;Bwa abumui bu cu'a bu ginbo i kwaji. Zwama Hwinsu kurya dangi bo na wa nibui nga̠ mahuna maba mai curya bwa bu yan na a̱huru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Kwa Yesu na lagana Yarus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:24">Aco na matanaga dinyiya a laga bware ciyabu na buba. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Aza bu'a buna bu yiwa na suwa aco dinyiya ia̠ haya ikope na harya na mahuna mai jigagu i mahya. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Bu'a buni bo hoge songorwa dinyiya na wa u hawalami ha asiti hinda bu hogi ka̠mu ina buba za, ka̠mu na haruni mahuna maza zibo kwa dandwo. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Nga̠ buba hoge kurwa u Yesu, kwa buba na tanbulage na kacuta ka Yesu na ihuga ina aco matanaga dinyiya na danga cilapo ci bware, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />zwama bu hin na soo u buba, &lt;&lt;Si na dangi cilapo ci bware kawai, na hwenga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Ai sanuwo inga iba danga cilapo ci Yesu jigagu i mahya kwa na curya kwa na hoge na ikanga i buba songorwa u buba u hogo. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Ai sanuwo kwa Yesu na hoge koce i sere na ikanga i buba. Kwa Yesu na byana aco na matanaga dinyiya na hin, &lt;&lt; Ganba bu dangi cilapo acimui?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Kwa silmajiri na cane Yesu, &lt;&lt; Bui hyanuwo aco na matanaga dinyiya na haruni bu ma zwamag, an ganba bu dangi cilapo a cimui?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ama Yesu ai curiwo i byangana buna bu dangi cilapo ci buba. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Bu'a buni, nga̠ buba daki ina aba ia̠gi bo, bu korya kwa na kuztan pa buna Yesu, buba na cidagaro zwama iwasa, bu zwamga bware ina buba ea kanmu kamahinda. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu a hin na buba, &lt;&lt;Bwa a bumui, i tano i soo na bui ibu hwingacuma. Ala labta soo mahuna amaboi ma bu curi na bu sungulacoma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yesu iba na cikarigo, kwa acuma na sire na yaba Yayirus, bulabe bu yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa. &lt;&lt;Bwa a bubui bu cu'a bu kwadwo,&gt;&gt; a hyan. &lt;&lt;Bai san ga̠hi i yiwa na dama Walami?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Yesu a i nga̠ a huguwa, kwa Yesu na zwamana bulabe bu Iginga i ahunda a Hayahudawa, &lt;&lt;Ta huga iwasa; itano i soo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yesu ai yadwuwa buciyahya bu laga bware kwa di Bitrus, Yakub na Yohana buhunwo bu Yakub. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Nga̠ Yesu aba wuci yaba i Yayirus bulabe bu yaba i ahunda̱ a Hayahudawa, Yesu a hyan iyaba i gyamacuwa, zwama acagiya aco na cidaro na kuce cagiya aco na sangana cu'ogo. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Nga̠ Yesu a ese yaba i Yariyus kwa na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Bai san ga̠hi i yiwa na cidaro na sangana cu'ogo? Bwa bui kwadwuwo bu yiwa na malabo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ama kwa aba na hinana i same Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Nga̠ Yesu iba silacume aco ka̠mu na ijapu, kwa bware na zangi buca bu bwa na amaci abuba na silmajiri sina buba kore na siba, kwa na ese ihuga ina aba labute bwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Bu konbe wa we ba kwa na hin na buba, &lt;&lt;Talita kumi!&gt;&gt; (wata, &lt;&lt;Bwa bu cu'a bu noya, Na hin na goo, masenge!&gt;&gt;). <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Ai sanuwo kwa bwa bu cu'a na masige jabaga (haya ha buba ikope na harya). Ini ka̠mu i san a hoge mamaki. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Kwa Yesu na numi ga hacobe ata zwamana aco ihya ina ia̠, kwa na hin a pa bwa mare bu re.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">A wonje Yesu na Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Kwa Yesu na curi payi kwa Bware na ala korwa ui i'ogo, Bware na Silmajiri bob. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Nga̠ hun ihupacu i Hayahudawa aba amaringe, bo hina icibaga aco na yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa i a̠hunda a Hayahudawa, aco dinyiya nga̠ aba hoge icibago i bware a hoge mamaki dinyiya hal ama kabo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:2">&lt;&lt;Hunba bware buba hin ina buba yiwa na eaga?&gt;&gt; a kaba. &lt;&lt;Iri maba mahasa buba za, hal buba yiwa na ia̠ga iyi mamaki! <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Sa bwa bu kapinta? Sa bwa bu Imaryamu na buhun bu Yakub, Yusuf,Yahuda na Saminu? Ahun a cu'a bware za tare na gaci?&gt;&gt; Hinda a hyan Bware bu hacigage ga suwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Kwa Yesu a hin na ba, &lt;&lt;Acubago Hwinsu aza cilabe na i'ogo ya ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yesu a eaguwo iyi mamaki payiyo, kwa i jukano i wa pa aco cimu zwama bu hwingacuma ga. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Bware bu hoge mamaki na nagu u itano soo yaba.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu a cuma silmajiri kupe na barya̠</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Kwa Yesu na kure na cibago aco daga mu'ogo kurwo mu'ogo. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Yesu a uga silmajiri si bware, kwa na cuman ga barya̠ bu pan sa koce pa mupyala mu eewo. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Ina aba zwama ga bini: &lt;&lt;Ita zanga ihya pa cihano kwa di agungu-ko burodi, ko ipamo, ita zanga musare na ibuwa ni hin. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Ima bwada hataka ita zanga hazunga ha mewa kwa di hana ha yiwa na ikanga nuhi. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Yesu a jidane hin naba Yaba na ga̠hi i ese ima dali apayi hal huna ga̠hi i ka̠ri curya i'ogo ini. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Hinda ihuga ina i wonje na ca ko i wonje i kubla, ina ga̠hi i ginbo i zwaman ga i ali, ui sanana sheda wa̠hya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Kwa silmajiri siba sere si zwamage cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu a curi eagu eewo. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />A silacuma mupyala mu eewo pa aco dinya a sukutage aco na aza mahuna manube hwingacome ga.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">A gunji icwa i Yohana i baptisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Aza Bugwama buna aba uga Hiridus a hoge ka̠mu ina i egyi, zwama iziya i Yesu i ese hacube ha aco, acagiya a zwamage, &lt;&lt;Ai Yohana i baptisma abe a asinge pa aco a kwaju, ube usa buba yiwa na eaga iyi mamaki.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Aco mewa a hin, Bube busa Iliya.&gt;&gt; Cagiya hinda, &lt;&lt;Bware busa acubago Hwinsu, bu nyaga na acubago na a sano.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ama nga̠ Hiridus aba hoge, kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Yohana ana gya na gunji icwa bware, a asinge bware pa aco a kwaju!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Zwama Hiridus na icwa yaba a hyin an a konbya Yohana, hinda a pare bo a gunda na yaba u ci'incu. Bware bu i haruni zwama Hirudiya, bu'a bu buhun Filibus, buna bware buba ze. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Zwama Yohana a zwa, a Hiridus, &lt;&lt;Ina buba i gyamacu bu ziye bu'a bu buhun bu bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Zwama haruni Hirudiya i kumgage cikarigo cini na soo ui ba i ginbage yina iba i hune Yohana. Ama i hinwo, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />zwama Hiridus a yiwa na hoge iwasa i Yohana a kumgage bware na burya̠, bu daki Yohana asa buco bu nagu magwata̱. I sa dame Hiridus sa hoge Yohana na cikarigo; ka̠mu na uni sa bu hoge laco u cikarigo ci Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Na ihogu Ihirondiya i hin yina. Hon ibutaryago na hun na aba mace Hiridus a tanaga mugwamgwam na musoja mu labe na aco labe Galili. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Hun lago nga̠ bwa bu cu'a bu Hirudiya buba hebe cihebo, hal bu san Hiridus na hanyagata ha hoge pa ire mare gita. Kwa bugwama na hin na bwa bu cu'a bu Ihirodiya, &lt;&lt;Na baba ina go bu ginbo kanmu,hinda gya na bu pan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Hinda hal na kucona, &lt;&lt;Ina go bu na kaba ka̠mu na bu pan, ko usala u ci cigwama acimui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Kwa buba na kore pa amaci a buba, &lt;&lt;Bai gya na kabana?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Kabana icwa Yohana ina i Baptisma,&gt;&gt; i cane bo. <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Ai sanuwo kwa bwa bu cu'a na yamana monda pa bugwama na ina buba ginbo: &lt;&lt;Na ginbo baniya an pa icwa i Yohana a Baptisma na suwa u iparanti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />nga̠ bugwama buba hoge kwa buba na hacigaga soo, ama zwama kucuna ku buba bu ma cune na haisa hanyagata pa ire mare gita, bui kanruwo yase bwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Bui sanuwo kwa bugwama buba na cuma buna bui gunje icwa i Yohana a kuleya. Kwa buba na kore pa yaba u ci'incu aba gunda Yohana na gunji icwa i bware, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />kwa na kole icwa na suwa ui iparanti. Bu kulage bwa bu cu'a, kwa buba na pan amaci a buba. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Nga̠ silmajiri sa Yohana siba hoge ina egyi, kwa siba kore na zangi ikanga i bware wubana na izin.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a ryacume aco dubu uta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Bayan muhun cimu acuma Yesu si matanaga pa Yesu kwa na zwamaga bware ka̠mu ina siba eagyi na icibago. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Hinda zwama, aco dinya a danje a zibi Yesu na silmajiri si bware ai hinwo dala aba ai re mare, kwa Yesu na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Kurya je ci mu kore ihuga ina iza aco ci hunpaci.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Kwa aba na ese jirgi u miya ihuga ina iza aco. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ama aco an a sirya mo'ogo dinya a hyan ga a daki an Yesu na silmajiri abe kwa aba na yamana monda na zwari Yesu na silmajiri si bware. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Nga̠ Yesu aba sire na jirigi kwa na hyan aco matanaga dinya, kwa bware na hoge yama yaba, zwama a yiwa inga hatami hana ha za buhubano. Bu hina icibaga aco i dinya. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Uyinbe u kari i, silmajiri si korya pa Yesu. &lt;&lt;Ihuga ina iza buciyahya,&gt;&gt; Yesu bu hin, &lt;&lt;Hinda hwinsu buna wa karwo i ese hila a gimbage ina aba ai re. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Zwamana aco a ese na suwa mu'ogo ko ai hyin mare ma aba ai re.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Ama Yesu bu cane ga, &lt;&lt;Pan je ga mare aba ai re.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Kwa aba na hin na Bware, &lt;&lt;Ci kore ci sanya mare na musarya muna mu wuci ina aba ai cupe buco kodago muna wuci ihurumu i musare mu pyana tataco! ga̠hi ni sicwa nubui pan ga mare aba ai re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu bu kaba ga, &lt;&lt;Iza haburodi habanba?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Alah i hyan.&gt;&gt; Nga̠ aba a kaba, kwa aba na hyin, &lt;&lt;Haburodi hata-na murege murya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Kwa Yesu na hin naba a zwama aco madale na humbe na cinge. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />A madalage aco dari uinka na ikope ta. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Nga̠ Bware buba zangaci burodi uta na murege murya kwa na byana zaro, kwa na pan Hwinsu cilabe kwa na busaga habrodi na murege muni. Kwa Bware na pana silmajiri pan ga aco. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />A re ka̠mu tagan bu sigi, <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />kwa silmajiri na tanaga mukinda mu burodi na murege mutasu ikupe na murya. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Muso wa aco na re mare an yase dubu kope ta.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a jabage zata u miya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Ai sanuwo kwa Yesu na hin na silmajiri si ese jirgi u miya si kaciya si sange bware u koro Betsaida, zwama bu ma hadgage aco na ma tanaga. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Nga̠ bware buba curi ga, kwa Bware na yindana a'ogo zwama bu i a̠hunda. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Nga̠ uyinbe i, u jirgi u miya uba na usa u uwo, Yesu buba na cinge. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Yesu bu hyan silmajiri siba na makicika na inumu i u jirgi, zwama bidwakwa bi miya. Na karpe ataco a gita kwa bware na kore pa ba, na jabaga zata u miya. Bware bu i nga̠ bu ginbo i hwace ga, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />ama inga siba hyan buba na jabaga zata u miya, a ingane bwar busa upataluwa. Kwa aba na sanana cu'ogo, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />zwama a hyan bware ka̠mu kwa iwasa na konbe ga. Ai sanuwo kwa na karigyane ga, &lt;&lt;Ita huga iwasa! gyamui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Kwa Bware na ese jirgi u miya uni pa ba yiwa, kwa mupyala na labuta. Kwa mamaki u konbe ga dinya, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />ai dakuwo iryacumo aco dubu na burodi; ha soo haba hai dakuwo ma'ana ini.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a hwingacume buco bu mahuna na Janisarat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Nga̠ Yesu na silmajiri sa bware aba kace uwo, kwa aba na wuci usala u janisarat kwa aba pare jirigi waba. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Nga̠ aba sere na suwa u jirgi u miya, aco kwa na ganya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />A kore na monda tonba usala na kolage aco mahuna na cibaro ihuga ina aba hoge Yesu aba yiwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Ka̠mu ihuga ina bware buba kore sihila̠, mu'ogo, ko hasakata-sa a labutage aco mahuna na ihuga ina aco ba matanaga. Sa une bware zwama a dangi kacuta ui cilapo ci bware, sa dangi bware sa ahwinge mahuna ma ba.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu a cibagi ina i sana buco ciriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Aza hun na Haparisiyawa na hawalami ha icibagu i cikarigo ci musa hana ha sirya na urshalima ha matanaga pa Yesu na <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />a hyan silmajiri siba na re mare na &lt;&lt;Ciri&gt;&gt; hinda, a ma guzagu siwa, <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(Haparisiyawa na Hayahudawa ka̠mu ha ryagwa mare kwa ha masitagi siwa, ha kumgage icibago i onga. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Sa a gyi kasuwa aza re mare kwa a masibtage buna na siwa. Hinda a kumgage ha cibagu dinya, nga̠ iguzagu i suwa wa adanda, mutako na mugwala.) <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Kwa Haparisiyawa na hawalami ha icibago i Musa a kaba Yesu, &lt;&lt;Bai sa silmajiri asibui si kumgago icibago i onga sa re mare na siwa si &lt;Ciri?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu a cyanega, &lt;&lt;Bucubagu bu Hwinsu Ishaya bu magalaganuwo nga̠ buba iyi cikarigo ina i eaga i hyin ga̠hi malapukai; nga̠ aba rubuci: &lt;&lt; &lt;Aco ayiwa na pan cilabe na unu yaba, ama ha soo haba ha mere na gya. <verse eid="MRK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />ana pangan cilabe kawui; icibago yaba isa iwugu ya aco kawui.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />I curi umurni na ina Hwinsu uba hin ana uba egyi kwa ga̠hi na kumbagu icibago ya aco.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Kwa Yesu na hyin naba: &lt;&lt;I pwa i curu umurni na cikarigo ci Hwinsu i kumgage icibago ya aco! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Zwama bucubagu bu Hwinsu Musa u hyin, &lt;Pana buca na amaci a bubo cilabe,&gt; hinda, &lt;Kanmu buna bu cwane buca ko amaci a buba a huni bwa.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ama i hin buna bu curi buci na amaci na nagu: &lt;Ina gya na kari na pan na rigana na pan Hwinsu daje), <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Harbuni ganhi gazaga buco bu pa buca buba na amaci a buba daje. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Na harbuni ganhi ringe cikarigo ci Hwinsu kawui zwama cikarigo ci woma cina ci ga̠hi yiwa na cibago saawo asihi. Harbuni ganhi i yiwa na eaga cage i dinya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">ina i sana buco ciriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Kwa Yesu na jidana ugan aco na matanaga kwa na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Ni kubliji, tigamaba, i daki uni, <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />sa iyi ijapu ina isa na soo u buco ibi i sana bwa nagu ciia Kwa di, ina ya sire na suwa u buco buza &lt;ciri.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Buna buza hacube i hugo bu huge. <verse eid="MRK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Nga̠ Yesu iba curi ihuga ina aco a matanaga bu ise na yaba, silmajiri si kaba bware bu zwama sa ina cikarigo ci misali cini ciba sa. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />&lt;&lt;ga̠hi ma ya dakuwo?&gt;&gt; Yesu a kaba ga. &lt;&lt;I dakuwo aza ijapu ina ise na suwo u buco i sana bwa &lt;Nagu ciri&gt;? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Zwama i suwa na soo u buco ama na suwa u mukaba, hinda surwa u ikanga.&gt;&gt; (Ni i zwamu i haruni, Yesu i hin ana mare ka̠mu maza &lt;&lt;Ciri.&gt;&gt;) <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Bware bu gupa hyin: &lt;&lt;Ina ya sire na suwa u buco ibe isa bwa &lt;Ciri.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Zwama na soo buco, eewo buba si bu wugi cidana, ihya, ihuno, ilaganu hagunki, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />Ukahe, kumbagu i buco na soo, rudu, ikaru ikanga, soo u siri, cizwama nagu u mahasa. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Ka̠mu eewo ini si sirya na soo u buco isa bu &lt;Ciri.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itanu i soo i bu'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu a curi ihuga ini kwa ni ala u sala u taya. Yesu a ise yaba hya i kanruwo bucahya bu daki; ka̠mu na haruni bware bwa panuwa bu masuyi pa aco. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />I sanuwo, nga̠ bu'a buni buba hugi kurwa u Yesu, bu'a buna buza bwa bu cu'a buna buza mahuna ma mupyala mu eewo bu kuri kwa ni kuztana Yesu pa buna bware. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Bu'a buniya busa Buheliniyawa, amci bo na Finikiya kwa buba na uni yesu a silacumi bwa bu buba bu mupyala mu eewo. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yesu i hyin na buba, &lt;&lt;Curya kacumo saawo si re ina siba gimba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Zwama wa iwo gama a zangi mare ma saawo a pa sewa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />&lt;&lt;Harbuni, Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu,&gt;&gt; Bu'a bu cyani, &lt;&lt;Ama ko sewa ma si sire mare ma saawo mana ma hoinagi zata tebur.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesu a zwama bu, &lt;&lt;Zwama macacuma amabui bu pwa ala; mupyala mu eewo mu curya bwa bu cu'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Kwa buba na ala giwo bu bangi bwa bu buba bu labce na cibaro hinda mupyala mu eewo mu curo bo<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a hwingacume upoke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yesu a curi usala u Taya kwa ni ala kurwo sidon, zubo kuro u uwo Galili na mu'ogo mukupe. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Apayi aco kulage bware bucahya buna busa upoke buna bui panuwo cikarigo, kwa aba ni une bware bu dangai bwa na wa. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu a zangi upoke huga ina aco buza dinya, kwa bware ni tane mubwab na suwa u hacube ha buba kwa bware na cwanga matambi kwa ni danga are a bu pwake. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Yesu kwa na byani zaro kwa ni zubo mubo muhunjo kwa na hyin na upoke, &lt;&lt;Iffata!&gt;&gt; ube usa &lt;&lt; Magunje!&gt;&gt;). <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Ni haruni, hacube ha upoke kwa ni ma gunja, are kwa ni masingya kwa buba ni hinana cikarigo na burya̠. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu a hin naba ata zwaman bucahya. ama i gazaganu ibware, sisa koce i cubaganu cikarigo ci buba. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Kwa aco na sinji na mamaki. &lt;&lt;Bware bu i burya̠ bu ia̠gi tibai na burya̠, a hin. &lt;&lt;Bware bu sa upoke u kargyaga hinda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu a ryacume aco dubu nasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Wa sanuwo aco dinyiya gope na matanagan. Aza ina aba ai re, Yesu kwa na oga silmajiri saba kwa na hin na saba, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />&lt;&lt;Na hoge yama aco na; a yiwa tare na gya hal muhun mutaco nawuya hinda aza ina aba ai re. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Si na hin naba a ali giwo na imerwa, ai ma ginda na yina, zwama aza aco na a sirya cimere.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Silmajiri sa cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Ama na hilo ane hunba gaci hyan mare man gaci ci pan aco na hilo na?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />&lt;&lt;Haburodi ha banba ganhi iza?&gt;&gt; Yesu a kaba ga. &lt;&lt;Utandarya,&gt;&gt; a cane bware. <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Kwa Yesu na zwaman aco na matanaga a ma dale na cinge. Nga̠ buba zangaci burodi kwa na danda zata na pan Hwinsu cilabe, bu busage kwa na pan silmajiri zwama si panga aco, kwa silmajiri na ia̠ harbuni. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Aza hinda murege cimu; nga̠ buba pan Hwinsu cilabe kwa hinda na pan silmajiri si panga aco. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Aco re hal a sigagi. Hal ma silmajiri si tangage mukinda mutasu utandarya <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />ina gane. Aco na a re a wuci dubu unasi. Kwa bware na cure aco ali yaba, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />A sanuwo kwa Yesu na silmajiri na ese na jirgi u miya na silmajiri si bware kuro pa usala Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haparisawa ha kaba Yesu i mamaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Inga Haparisiyawa ha korya na hinana makabo Yesu. Zwama a gwaji bware, a kabo bware bu cibe ga i mamaki ina Hwinsu uba pan ai daki pa koce bware iba sire na zaro. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu a zibi muhunjo na soo kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Bai san aco doone una aba yiwa na ginbo a cibe ga i mamaki? Kamahinda na zwama, aza na ciba ihya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Kwa Yesu na curi ga kwa na marigya na suwa u jirigi u miya kwa na kaca ukacaso u wo.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yisti a Haparisiyawa na ana Hiridus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Silmajiri sa Yesu si mainga na zangi burodi kwa di uinka siba sa zangya na suwa u jirgi u miya. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu a buta Silmajiri, &lt;&lt;Masikai.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;I masikai na iyi eewo inga Haparisiyawa na ana a hiridus,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Silmajiri si ma zwama siba kwa na hyin, &lt;&lt;Zwama gaci za burodi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Nga̠ Yesu aba daki cikarigo cina ci aba na mazwaman, bware bu kaba ga: &lt;&lt;Bai sa ga̠hi yiwa na ia̠ cikarigo ci nagu u burodi? hal kabaniya i hyanuwo hinda i dakuwo? halkabaniya iza danru soo? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Iza haisa ama hasa ha hyanagu, na hacube haisa ha hugago? hinda i ma buturyagya? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Nga̠ gya na busage burodi uta zwama a ryacume aco dubu ta, mutasu mu bamba ganhi tanaga mu kinda muna mu gane?Silmajiri ikope na sirya sa cane,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ikupe na urya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />&lt;&lt;Nga̠ gya na busage burodi utandarya zwama gya ryacune aco dubu nasi, mutasu mu bamba mu mukinda mu bamba ga̠hi tanaga?&gt;&gt; kwa Silmajiri na cane &lt;&lt;Mutasu u tandarya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Yesu a hin naba, &lt;&lt;Hal kabaniya isa dakuwo cikarigo a cimu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a hwmgacume burubu na Betsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Nga̠ aba a kurya Betsaida, kwa aco na kulagi Yesu burubo a une Jesus bu hwingacume bwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Kwa yesu na kumbe wa u burubu kwa na silacume ba ni japu. Nga̠ Yesu aba cwangi matambi na haisa ha burubu kwa bware na jukana bo wa, kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Bu hyan ihya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Burubu bu danda icwa kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Na hyan aco; a nyaga na u'on na maringa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu a jidani i danga haisa ha burubu. Kwa haisa na rubca, kwa bware na hyan tibai na burya̠. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu kwa na hin na buba bu ali giwo, &lt;&lt;Ta isa suwo hila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">I yajo i Bitrus Yesu asa Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu na silmajiri siba i ise mu'ogo mu nuya Kaisariya Filibi. aba na yina u kuro Yesu a kaba ga, &lt;&lt;Biya aco ayiwa nabu uga?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Silmajiri si cyani yesu, &lt;&lt;Cagiya a hin busa Yohana u baptisma; acagiya aco a hin busa Iliya; acagiya aco Acubago Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />&lt;&lt;Ama ganhi pa?&gt;&gt; Yesu a kaba ga. &lt;&lt;I hin ana gya nasa gamba?&gt;&gt; kwa Bitrus na cyane, &lt;&lt;Gabuya busa Kristi bu cyagagu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yesu a numega hacobe ata zwamana aco.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a zwame u'o u bware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Yesu a hina i cibago ga i sungula Bwa bu Buwama na iyi dinya hinda a'onga i wonje bo, alabe a yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa na hawalami a icibago cikarigo ci Musa, i hune bo muhun mutaco hinda bui masinga. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Bware bui swangago ga na cikarigo ciniya, kwa Bitrus na uga bware usala uinka zwama Yesu a butana bo <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ama Yesu ama biciki kwa na byana silmajiri si bware, kwa bware na butana Bitrus, &lt;&lt;Maciki ahwamui, goo buco bu eewo!&gt;&gt; Yesu a hin. &lt;&lt;Soo nubui uza iyi Hwinsu, kwa iyi ya aco.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Kwa bware na uga aco na matanaga na silmajiri si buba kwa na hin: &lt;&lt;Sa aza buna bu ginbo kure ahwamui bu wunje icwa i buba bu zangi u'on masacu bu ni lagana. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Zwama buna bu ka̠ri cyagaga a̱huru a buba bui nagi ah, ama buna bu nagi ahuru a buba zwama gya na cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu bui hyan ah. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Umba gama yiwa buco bu hyin icwana i doone, bu nagi a̱huru a buba? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ko hinda na bai buco buba bui samgo a̱huru a buba? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Ka̠mu buna bu hugi mu'iya amamui na cikarigo muniya na doone uni u sinji na cidana na eewo, Bwa bu Buwama bui hugi mu'iya u buba hun na buba bui maringe na cilabe ci Buca buba na acuma a nagu ciri a Hwinsu.<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Kwa Yesu a hin naba, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na zwama, aza aco na yiwa na gya pini ana aza i kwaji kwa a hin cigwama ci Hwinsu na koce woba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">U sako u Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Nga̠ munhun cunihi muba ali Yesu a zangi Bitrus, Yakub na Yohana danjo wui i'ogo ihuga ina bucahya buza kwa aba na hyan bware na bu ma saki. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Hazunga ha bware kwa na cine, cine uniya u zake tibai ina aba i guzagu na doone. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ui sanuwo kwa aba na hyana acubago Hwinsu Iliya na Musa, aba na kargyaga na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Kwa Bitrus na hin na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Walami, u i gama na gaci ci yan pini. Ca i hazaka hataco-uinka nubui, uinka Musa na ucagiya Iliya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />(Bitrus a nagi ina aba ai zwame zwama iwasa i kumbe bware.) <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Kwa ulala na zibi na kuptana ga, kwa aba na huge cikarigo na suwo ulala: &lt;&lt;Bwa bu mui abuna, buna bu gya na ka̠ri. I kuble bo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Wa sanuwo, inga aba byane, a hyanuwo buca hya naba kwa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Aba na kanzigya zata wui i'ogo, Yesu a nume ga hacube ata zwamana buco hya ina aba hyan kwa hun Bwa bu Buwama buba masinge pa aco na akwado. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Cikarigo ciniya a iri ca na hasuwa haba, aba na kaban ina &lt;&lt;Wasinguwo aco pa aco a kwado.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Kwa aba na kaban bware, &lt;&lt;Bai sa hawalami ha cikarigo ci Musa haba hin ana Iliya i rwagu i kure?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda bucuma Iliya bui sanga i kure, Bu ringiya iyi kanmu. Hinda a rubuci na cikarigo ci Hwinsu na Bwa bu Buwama ai sungula bo dinya hinda a wanje bo? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Ama na zwama, Iliya i kurwa, hinda a eagyi bware ina aba gimbo, inga aba rubuci ina i eaga na bware.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a hwingacume bwa bu mupyala mu eewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Nga̠ Yesu na silmajiri sitaco aba a maringiya pa silmajiri si ma yiwa, a bangya aco dinyiya amatanaga na hawalami hai icibago i Musa aba na ea masasa naba. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />A sanuwo nga̠ aco aba hyan Yesu, kwa mamaki na kumbe ga dinyiya kwa aba na eyaman munda zwama a sani Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu a kaba silmajiri sa ba, &lt;&lt;Masasa ma bai ganhi iyiwa na eaga na aba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Kwa bucahya na suwo wa aco na cane, &lt;&lt;Walami, na bu kulage bwa bu mui, buna bu mupyala mu eewo muba gazga bo na cikarigo. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Sa mupyala mu eewo mu kumbe bo, musa mu kwama bo na cinge. hapucoco na sirya na uno, busa bu ma hake haila hinda bu manumi na zwama silmajiri asa bui sa silacuma mupyala mu eewo, ama si mayage.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Gahin azwaga aco nagu iyajo &lt;&lt;Hal kuro bimba gya na yana na ganhi? Hal bimba gya na yan pwa na ga̠hi? Na kulagiya je bwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Kwa aba na kulagiya Yesu bwa buni. Inga mupyala mu eewo muba hyan Yesu i sanuwo kwa mupyala mu eewo na silacuma bwa buni. Kwa buba na ma kwaman na cinge na magimbulaga, hapucoco na silage na uno.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu a kaba buca bu bwa, &lt;&lt;Binba buba rwage haruna?&gt;&gt; Buco bu cane, &lt;&lt;Tun buba bwa bu nuya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />&lt;&lt;Mupyala mu eewo musa mu kwama bwa na ula ko miya zwama mu hune bo. Ama sa bui pwana eagya bo iyha, Huga yama nuci ci egyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu a cane bo, &lt;&lt; &lt;Bai sa go bu hin na gya ko na pwan?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ai i ka̠mu i ma ea pa buco buna bu yaje.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Ai sanuwo kwa buca bu bwa bu cware na cane, &lt;&lt;Na yaje; ama na banga na cagage nagu u itano soo numui!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Nga̠ Yesu aba hyan aco na matanaga ihuga ina aba yiwa, kwa bware na butana mupyala mu eewo. Yesu a hin, &lt;&lt;Goo mupyala mu cibebe na cipuke,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Na hin na goo, sila pa bware hinda ta isakana soo u bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Mupyala mu eewo kwa na sanana ci'ogo, kwa na sana bwa bu mate kwa na sire na kuce. Bwa kwa na manumya nga̠ bu kwaji, Hal ma aco a hin ana &lt;&lt;Bu kwajo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ama kwa Yesu na kumbe wa u buba na yasinga bo bu yinsa, kwa buba na masinga. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Nga̠ Yesu aba na silmajiri ese na suwo yaba, silmajiri si kaba bware na cisui, &lt;&lt;Bai sa gaci ma yage i ace mupyala mu eewo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu a cyane, &lt;&lt;Iri mupyala muna ma za sire kwa na ahunda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a i cikarigo ci u'o u bware hinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu na silmajiri a curi payi kwa na lagan Galili. Yesu a kanruwo bucohya bu daki ihuga ina aba yiwa, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />zwama bu yanse na cibaga silmajiri si buba. Kwa Yesu na hin na silmajiri sa aba, &lt;&lt;Gya Bwa bu Buwama ai cutana bo na wa u aco u magwata̠ ai huni bware,sa muhun mutaco mu ali na masinga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ama ai dakuwo ina Yesu bu yiwa na kargyaga hinda a hugi iwasa aba ai kabana bware.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gamba busa bu labe?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Nga̠ aba wuci Kaparnahun. Yesu aba ese na yaba na silmajiri si bware, kwa bware na kabana ga, &lt;&lt;Masasa ma bai ganhi ya yiwa na eaga na yina?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ama ai cana bware zwama aba na yina a i masasa gamba busa bu labe. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Kwa Yesu na madala kwa na uga silmajiri ikupe na sirya kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Ka̠mu buna bu gimbo sana bu jigo, dole bu noya, hinda busa bugyama bu ka̠mu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Kwa Yesu na zangi bwa bu nuya na sana bo bu yinsa na usa waba. Kwa na zangaca bwa na ucucu u buba, kwa na hin na ba, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />&lt;&lt;Ka̠mu buna bu ce bwa bu nuya na ize nimui gyamui buba ni ce; hinda ka̠mu buna buni ce sa gyamui buba na ce ama bu ce buna bwa ni cuma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanmu buna bu ci wonjuwa na gaci busa abuci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohana ana asa almajiri a Yesu a hin, &lt;&lt;Walami,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ci hyan bucahya na silacumaga mupyala mu eewo na iziya nubui hinda ci hin na buba bu curi, zwama buza tare na gaci.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Ita gazgana bo.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Aza buna bui i iyi mamaki na ize nimui hinda bu i cikarigo ci eewo zwama gya, <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Zwama buna bu yaji na gaci busa abuci. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Kamahinda na zwama, kanmu buna bui pan miya ma ciso na ize nimui zwama ganhi isa alagano a Kristi ca daje. i buba ko cimu.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ta sana buco bu i magwata̠</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />&lt;&lt;Sa aza buna bui sana saawo sina si nuya sina si yaje na gya si i magwata̠, ui zaki a pare bo na uhiwu a kwama bo na suwo u uwo. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Si wa nibui wui sana goo i magwata̠, gunda uwa gipi uwa. wui bu zakan goo ese yaba i hupacu i Hwinsu na ukinda u wa na una u goo bui ese yaba ula na siwa sirya, ihuga ina ula uba iza ikwaji. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Ihuga ina &lt;&lt; &lt;Hacici haba aza i kwaji, ula hinda iza kwaji.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Hinda sa buna nibui wui sana bu i magwata̠, gunda kwama uwa. Ui bu zakana goo ese yaba i hupacu i Hwinsu na ukinda u buna na una u goo bui ese ula na buna birya. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Ihuga ina &lt;&lt; &lt;Hacici haba aza i kwaji, ula hinda iza kwaji.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Hinda sa yisa nibui i bu sana goo i magwata̠, zaciga haisa ni. ui bu zakana goo ese yaba Cigwama ci Hwinsu na yisa uinka na una u goo bui ese yaba ula na haisa barya, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Ihuga ina &lt;&lt; &lt;Hacici haba aza i kwaji, ula hinda iza kwaji.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Ai kimgana tigamba na ula inga aba sa kimga pisu na manje.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />&lt;&lt;Manje masa i burya̠, ama si manje ma nagi laco maba, na biya aba ai kimgana? Zana je manje ma ci'osa na suwo nuhin, hinda i iyi dala a burya̠ na tigamba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu a cibage i ihono i cigya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu a curi ihuga ini kwa na ala usala u Yahudiya kurwa usala u jordan. Hinda aco na matanaga kwa na kore pa Bware, nga̠ bware buba eagagu, bware bu cibage ga. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Kwa Haparisiyawa na kore zwama a gwaji Yesu kwa na kabana, &lt;&lt;Ni icibago ci Musa u i gama buco bu mahandgage na bu'a bu buba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Bai Musa uba hin na ga̠hi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Kwa aba na hin, &lt;&lt;Musa u yaje ci pan utakada ai ihono i cigya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu a cane ga, Zwama danri u hasoo a hahin ube usan Musa uba yaje i rubutu umurni u mahangage na si'a a sihin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />&lt;&lt;Ama na jigu inga Hwinsu uba eagyi doone &lt;Hwinsu u i buco bu cware na buco bu cu'a.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />&lt;Zwama haruniyo buco bu curya buca bu buba na amaci a buba asan i bikan na bu'a bu buba, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />hinda ka̠mu waba aco barya ai sana ikanga bikan.&gt; A sawa aco barya, ama buika. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Zwama haruni aco na Hwinsu uba gami ga tare bucohya buta hangaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Nga̠ Yesu na silmajiri aba gope i ese yaba, silmajiri sa kaba Yesu zwama icbago ini. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Buna bu mahandgage na bu'a bu buba bwa ze bucage bu'a bu iyi cidana na si'a buba bwa ze . <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Hinda sa bu'a bube bu mahandgage na bware bu buba bu i cigya na bucage buco, buba ma bu eagu cidana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a tane saawo sa noya uno u burya̠</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Aco kulage saawo sa noya pa Yesu zwama a tane sa uno u burya̠, ama silmajiri sa butana ga. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Inga Yesu aba hyan ina silmajiri siba ea, i hogo laco. Kwa Bware na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Curya je saawo sa noya sa kurya ahwamui, hinda ita gazgana ga, zwama cigwama ci Hwinsu cisa iri waba. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Kamahinda na zwama, ka̠mu buna bui yajuwa bu ce cigwama ci Hwinsu na icwa buba inga bwa noya buba si bu yaje hacaca ha i cugwama na buba buza ise cugwama ci Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Kwa Yesu na zangi saawo si noya, kwa jukana siwa sa Bware na tana sa unu burya̠.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulagasa bui izana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Nga̱ Yesu aba ginbage ala, kwa bucohya na eyaman munda korwo pa Yesu na kuztan bware, kwa buba na hin na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Walami u burya̠.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Bai gya na ea zwama gya hin a̱huru ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Kwa Yesu na hin na buco bui izana, &lt;&lt;Bai san go bu na uga buco bu burya̠?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Aza buna bu sa bu burya̠ kwa Hwinsu ube. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Bu daki ina cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hin: &lt;Ta hona buco, ta iyi cidana, ta iyi ihya, ta zwama ina goo bui hyanuwo, ta eagya buco mogota, pan buca abobo na amaci nabo cilabe.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Kwa buco na hin na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Walami,&gt;&gt; Ini ka̱mu i gya tun gya bwa bo noya na laga ini ka̱mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu a byane bo, kwa buba na ka̱la̱ngi bo. &lt;&lt;I bikan go bu ginbo,&gt;&gt; Yesu bu hin. &lt;&lt;Ala, sange tibe ka̱mu na goo bu za habusage aco na za ihya musare, hinda bui hyan izana na cigwama ci Hwinsu. Go kurya, na laganya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Na i hogo cikarigo cini, kwa buco na hacigage soo. Zwama bu za izana dinya.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Kwa Yesu na byana Silmajiri sa bware, &lt;&lt;Ui gaguma buco bu izana bu ise cigwama ci Hwinsu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Silmajiri sa Yesu sa hoge mamaki u cikarigo ci Bware. Ama kwa Yesu na hin naba hinda, &lt;&lt;Saawo a simui, we gaguma eso cigwama ci Hwinsu! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Ui sana sauki Urakumi u ese na iyisa ya ajimula na buco bu izana bu ese cigwama ci Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Nga̠ Silmajiri siba hoge haruni kwa mamaki na konbe sa, kwa siba na mazwamana na sicwa saba, &lt;&lt;Susa harbuni ganba bui ese yaba cigwama ci Hwinsu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Kwa Yesu na byana ga, &lt;&lt;Pa aco uza na ma ea, ama sa pa Hwinsu, pa Hwinsu i ka̠mu ui ma ia̠.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Kwa Bitrus na hin na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Ci curi ka̠mu ina gaci za ci zwama ci bu laga!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda gya na zwama,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Aza buna bui curi yaba buba ko ahun cware ko hunwo si'a ko amaci ko buca ko saawo ko inta u buba zwam gya ko cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />buna bu curi ini, bui hyan izana ikope ikope (I yaba, ahun cware, ahun cu'a, simaci, saawo na ha'inta na iso i wahala) na haya hana ha yiwa korwa, Hwinsu ai pan ga a̠huru ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Aco jigu ai marenge kacuta, hinda aco kacuta ai maringe jigu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a jidane ea cikarigo ci u'o u Bware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Aba na koro Urshalima, Yesu a sange, hinda silmajiri na lagana Bware saba na hoge mamaki, hinda cyagiyaco na a laga a hoge iwasa. Yesu a oga silmajiri ikope na sirya bu ujane sa kwa na zwama ga ina i ea na Bware. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />&lt;&lt;Gaci abuna ci ginbo i kore Urshalima,&gt;&gt; Yesu bu hyin naba, &lt;&lt;Hinda ai cuta Bwa bu Buwama pa bulabe bulabe na hawalami icibago i Musa. Ai hune Bware hinda ai cutan bware pa aco na ai sa Hayahudawa, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Ai eagana Bware alala cwani Bware hatanbi, ai swace bware hinda a hune Bware. Mohun mutaco Bware bui masenga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Una u Yakub na Yohana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Kwa saawo sa Zabadi, Yakub na Yohana, na kore pa Yesu. &lt;&lt;Walami,&gt;&gt; kwa aba na kabana, Ci eagyi ina gaci ci ka̱ri ci bu ona.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu a kaba ga, &lt;&lt;Bai ga̠hi ginbo gya i eagyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Kwa Yakub na Yohana aba na cane Bware, &lt;&lt;Ci ginbo go yaje buco buikan bu madale na wa u cuga bu cage hinda na wa u gula na izangacu acibui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesu a cane ga &lt;&lt;Ya dakuwo ina ga̠hi i kabo,&gt;&gt; Yesu a hin naba. &lt;&lt;I pwana i so wahala una gya na ka̱ri iso ko hinda baptisma ana aba ka̠ri na eagya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />&lt;&lt;Ci pwana,&gt;&gt; kwa aba cane Bware.Yesu a hin naba, &lt;&lt;I so wahala una u gya na so na baptisma ana aba na eagyi, <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />ama dala na wa ucuga ko una u gula wa sa ipano nimuiyo. ihuga ini isa ya aco na aba iriga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Inga silmajiri ikope siba hoge kwa siba na dabe suwa na Yakub na Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Kwa Yesu a uga silmajiri kupe na barya kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;I daki an aco na sa mugwamgwam mu aco na ai sa Hayahudawa sa pan ga ibwana ina i hwace koce waba, hinda alabe ba sa ga koce u cilabe. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Ama san sa harbuni uba ui san na ganhi, ka̠mu buna bu ginbago bu sa bulabe dole bu sa bugyama a buhin, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />hinda buna bu gimbago bu sa bu jigu dole bu san bugyama bu mu. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Zwama Bwa bu Buwama bu korya zwama a pa a̠ cilabe, ama zwama bu pan cilabe, hinda bu pan a̱huru a buba icewo aco dinya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a hwingacome burubo buna abu ugo Bartimawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Nga̠ aba wuci Yeriko.Yesu na silmajiri sa Bware, aco dinya na lagana Bware, aba na siro i'ogo i Yeriko, a bangi buruba iziya ibuba Bartimawus buna busa bwa bu Timawus bu madale na ugagi u jubu na eaga una. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Nga̠ buba hoge an Yesu i Nazaret, abe a yiwa koro, kwa buba na hinana sagana cu'ogo, &lt;&lt;Yesu, Bwa u Dauda, huga yama nimui!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Aco dinya a butana bu an bu otani, ama kwa buba na jidana isana cu'ogo dinya, &lt;&lt;Bwa bu Dauda huga yama na mui <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu a yinsa kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;ugana je bo.&gt;&gt; kwa aba na uga buruba, &lt;&lt;Ea wawo! Masenge! Yesu a yiwa na bu oga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Kwa bware kwamana ulapo u bware, kwa buba na mazareka kwa na kore pa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />&lt;&lt;Bai go bu ginbo gya bu egyi?&gt;&gt; Yesu a kabo bware. Kwa burubo na cane, &lt;&lt;Rabbi, Na ginba hyanaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />&lt;&lt;Ala,&gt;&gt; Yesu a hin, &lt;&lt;I tano i soo nebo ibu hwingacuma.&gt;&gt; Ai sanuwo kwa haisa ha bware na ma gunjakwa na hinana i lagana Yesu na yina<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Iso u Yesu Urshalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Nga̠ aba yabuta Urshalima a korya Betafaji na Betani na a'ogo a Zaitun, Yesu kwa na cuman silmajiri si Bware, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />na hin na siba, &lt;&lt;Kula je na suwa ui i'ogo ina i gaci ci biskai, na iso nuhin, i hyan bwa bo Aziyaki bu pare, bucyahya bwa si yindanuwa an. I pasinga i koleya apini. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Sa bucohya bu i kabo, &lt;An bai san ga̠hi i yiwa na pasingya?&gt; I zwama bo, &lt;Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu i ginbago an hinda bui ringe an baniya.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />A kore kwa na bangi iyawo ya aziyaki kwa i pare i'iba i yaba ciyabu na yina. Inga aba pasingi an, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />aco na yansinga payi kwa na kaban ga, &lt;&lt;Beya ganhin i ginbo i eaga, na i pasingya ga bwa bo aziyaki?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />A cane inga Yesu aba zwama ga, kwa aco na cure ga a ali na Aziyake a noya. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Nga̠ aba a kolage Yesu bwa bo aziyaki kwa aba na bare hazunga haba zata, kwa Yesu na madala zata waba. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Aco dinya a bare hazunga haba na yina, acagiya aco a gundage habwabwa ha i'on hana aba a gundage na hasakata. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Na aco na ali zata na ana a laga kacuta a hina na tana ci'ogo Hosana! iyi burya̠ u yan na buna yiwa na kore na iziya i Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">&lt;&lt;Cilabe ci Hwinsu!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Uno u burya̠ usa buna bwa korya na iziya i Hwinsu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />&lt;&lt;Hwinsu usan uno u burya̠ usa cigwama ci Buca a buci Dauda!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Hosana Azangaci cilabe ci Hwinsu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu a ese Urshalima kwa aba na ala iso yaba ahunda̱ a Hayahuawa i ahunda a hayahudawa kwa bware na byana tibai na suwa ui yaba ahunda̱ Hayahuawa, ama nga̠ uyinbe u iwo, kwa bware na kure Betani na silmajiri si bware ikope na sirya.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a tane i'on u coco unu eewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Nga̠ ubongwa uba u bonge Yesu aba na yina u korwa u Betani, Yesu a hoge imerwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Kwa bware na biska u'on u muco na ubunba ha siri, bu kore ciyabu ko bui hya imata. inga bware buba wuci na ipicu, uza imata kwa habonba, zwama sa lokaci u imata i muco. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Kwa bware hin na u'on u coco, &lt;&lt;Buciyahya buta ryakana imata neboya hal ihogu.&gt;&gt; Silmajiri si bware kwa sa kubli.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Nga̠ aba wuci Urshalima, kwa Yesu na ese Iginga i ahunda a Hayahudawa na hinana antanga aco na yanse na sanga na isango i.Bo hina i bicikag hatebur na habenci hana aba yanse na eaga isako i musare na aco na yanse na sanga mutarkagu, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Yesu bu yanse tiganba na zangi ihya na suwa ui yaba ahunda̱ a Hayahuawa ihuga ahuNa̱ a hayahudawa. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Hinda Yesu nga̠ cibage ga, kwa na hin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">&lt;&lt;Ai rubucuwo: &lt;&lt; &lt;I yaba numui isana iyaba ya ahunda pa aco mu'ogo ka̠mu.&gt; &gt;&gt;? Ama i rigiwa iyaba numui ukwaju u ahya.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Alabe alabe na hawalami hai icibago cikarigo ci Musa a hoge kwa aba na ginbaga yina aba ai hune Yesu, A hoge iwasa i bware, zwama a hyan aco na matanaga a hoge mamaki u icibago i bware.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Nga̠ uyinbe uba i, Yesu na silmajiri sa ba a sere i'ogo.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">I'on u coco una Yesu aba tane uno eewo u padare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Nga̠ ubugwa uba bonge, aba na jabaga na yina, kwa aba na hyan u'on u muco u padare ka̠mu na haganda hoba. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Bitrus a mabutaryage kwa hin na Yesu, &lt;&lt;Walami, Byana! U'on u muco una go bu tane uno u eewo padaro!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Tana soo na Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Kamahinda na zwama, &lt;&lt;Ka̠mu buna hin i'ogo ina, &lt;Ala, makwama na suwa uwo,&gt; hinda sa bui zaciga soo na ina buba zwame ama bu yaje ina buba zwame ui yana harbuni, ai eagya bo. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Zwama haruni na zwama, ina ka̠mu ga̠hin kabo na a̠hunda nahin, tana soo an bu hyan gya, hinda i san nabua̠i. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Hinda sa bu yinsa bu yiwa na a̠hunda, sa bu kumgage bucoyahya na soo, curya bo, nga̠ buca a buhin buna bu yiwa na zaro bui yape magwata̠ amahin ina ga̠hi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Ama sa bui yape aco magwata̠ ma aba bu eagyi Hwinsu una u yiwa na zaro buza na bu yape goo ma.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">A eagyi Yesu makabo ma koce bware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Nga̠ aba gope i wuci Urshalima, Yesu aba na suwa we yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa ilabe na alabe alabe, na hawalami hai icibago i Musa na onga a korya pa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />A kaba Yesu, &lt;&lt;Na kuce ganba goo bu yiwa na iaga ina go bu eagu?&gt;&gt; Hinda ganba bu pan koce una?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Gya na eagya makabo maikan. Na cane, gya hinda na zwama na koce buna bu gya na eagu ina. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Na zwamanya je Baptisma a Yohana a sere na zaro, ko pa aco?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Kwa aba na mazwamana na sicwa saba, &lt;&lt;Sa ci hin, &lt;Pa Hwinsu na zaro,&gt; bware bui hin na gaci, &lt;Bai san ga̠hi i yadwo na Yohana i Baptisma?&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ama si ci hin, &lt;Pa aco&gt;....&gt;&gt; (A hoge iwasa ya aco, zwama aco ka̠mu yaje an Yohana asa Acubago Hwinsu.)<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Kwa aba na cane Yesu cidakuwo, &lt;&lt;Ci dakuwo.&gt;&gt; Kwa Yesu na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Gya ma na za na zwamana koce buna bu gya na ia̠gu ina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Misali u buco buna bu ce haya u inta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yesu a hina ne eagya Alabe cikarigo na misali: &lt;&lt;Bucahya bu i inta na mazita ma yaba. Kwa buba na rigana on inta, kwa buba na gabe ulanbi una ai pilanga imata i inabi. Kwa buba na pana haya u inta pa buco bu cuma kwa na ma'alana kurwa u cihano. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Nga̠ hun imata i inabi iba yene kwa buba na cumana bugyama bu buba bu cagiya bu imata i inta mazita ma yaba. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ama kwa aco na i haya na konbe bugyama buna aba cuma kwa na laje bwa ihuna kwa na curya bu ali siwa sirya ko na ihya. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Kwa buba na gopa i cumana bugyama bu mewa; kwa aba na buze bu na icwa kwa aba na eagya ina i sa bu hoge mu'eya. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Bu jidane i cumana bugyama bu mewa, kwa aba na hune bu. Bu gope cumana cagiya dinya; a supagi ga, acagiya a hune.<verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />&lt;&lt;Bu gane buco buika buna buba bui cumana, wata bwa bu buba, buna buba ka̠ri. kwa buba na cuman buni buika buna bu gane, kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Na daki ai pan bwa a bumui cilabe,&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />&lt;&lt;Ama inga bwa bubu wuci aco haya aba hyan bwa bu buba na kore kwa aba na mazwaman, &lt;&lt;Buna bui re gado u inta abuna. Kurya, ci mu hune bu, nga̠ gadwo u enta uba ui san nuci.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Kwa aba na konbe bwa bu buco bu enta kwa na hune bu, kwa na kwamana i'o i boba na ijapu i inta. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Kwa Yesu na kaba Biya buco bu inta buba ea? &lt;&lt;Bui korya bu hune aco haya ka̠mu bu hinda bu pa aco menwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />I huguwa ina cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hin: &lt;&lt; &lt;Tare una aco ema aba yagage ube u maringe usa tare u zake hatare hai ema gama; <verse eid="MRK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu ube u i ini, hinda ibe isa i mamaki na haisa a haci&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">icipo i ganju pa kaisar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Nga̠ a'unga a hayahudawa a hina iginbaga yina aba ai konbe Yesu zwama a hyan misali u cikarigo cina Yesu aba zwamage bu i zwama abe. Ama a hoge iwasa aco na matanaga; kwa aba na curya bware kwa na ala. <verse eid="MRK 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Nga̠ i iba majidane kwa aba ne cumana Haparisiyawa na aco Hiridus ana yiwa uno uika na Hiridus a kurya a konbe Yesu aba ginbage yina una aba ai eaga pa cikarigo ci bware. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Kwa aba ne korya pa Yesu na hin, &lt;&lt;Walami u kamahinda, ci daki busa buco buna aba yaje na buba. Bui ma damuwa na ina aco aba ai hyin na gowo zwama ina goo bu zwame, bu zangi aco asa i bikan; hinda bu yiwa na cibaga ina Hwinsu uba hyin an aco eagyi kamahinda. U gyamace a cupe ganju pa kaisar ko ui gyamaco? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Ci cupe ko hinda ci curi?&gt;&gt; Yesu a daki malapunci maba, kwa na hyin naba. &lt;&lt;Bai san ga̠hi i ginbo na kaciba akahin?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Na kulageya musare muna ga̠hi i cupago gandwu, na hyanu nga̠ muba nyaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Kwa aba na kulage Yesu musare mun aba cupago gandwu, kwa Yesu na kaban ga, &lt;&lt;Sinu ganba i yiwa na musare muna? na cihero cina ci yiwa na musare?&gt;&gt; A cane, &lt;&lt;Sinu i Kaisar&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Kwa Yesu na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Pan je Kaisar ina sa i Kaisar ina sa Hwinsu i pa Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; Kwa aba na hoge mamaki a Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">makabo a wasingo pa aco gwajo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Kwa Hasadaukiyawa, hana hai yadwuwa na yasingo u'o, na korya pa Yesu na makabo. <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />Kwa aba kabana Yesu, &lt;&lt;Walami,&gt;&gt; Musa u ci rubuci an sa buhun bu buco bu kwaji bu gaji bu'a ai buza saawo, buhun bu swata bu'a zwama bu hyangiyo buhun bu buba saawo. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Baniya a̠hun ni a yanse aba aco utandarya. Bu jigu bu ze kwa na kwaji bui macuwa saawo. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Buna bu lagi bu swata bu'a buna bware buba kwaji, buba hinda kwa na kwaji, bui macuwa bwa. Harbuni bu tacula. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Harbuni kanmu anhuwo u tandarya, aza buna mace bwa. Na ikundagu kanmu, bu'a buni kwa buba ma na kwaji. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Wahya na yasingo ya aco a kwadaga bui san bu'a bu ganba, nga̠ kanmu waba utandarya̠ a ze bo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Hasuwa a hahin hai iwo na burya̠ na cikarigo ci Hwinsu hinda i dakuwo koce i Hwinsu? <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Sa aco na kwaji masenge, aza i ea cigya ko a zeya; ai nyagana inga acuma a Hwinsu zata u zaro. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Baniya game na asingo aco na kwaji, i karancuwa na utakada u Musa, ihuga ina bware buba hyan hila na ca ula, inga Hwinsu uba hin na Musa, &lt;Gyamui na sa Hwinsu Ibrahim, Hwinsu u Ishaku,na Hwinsu u Yakub&gt;? <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Uba ui sa Hwinsu wa aco a kwadwo, hinda u sa Hwinsu aco na ai kwajuwo. I ea magwata̠ dinyiya,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inumu i hacube bulabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Walami u cikarigo ci Musa u kublisa ga aba na masisa mani. Nga̠ uba hoge Yesu a cane ga na burya̠, kwa uba na kabana Yesu, &lt;&lt;Ka̠mu umurni na cikarigo ci numu i hacobe cinba ci zake sana ci labe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu a cane ga, &lt;&lt;Cina cisa ci labe,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Cina cisa: &lt;Huga je, aco Isra'ila,Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu, Hwinsu u yiwa uikan. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />ka̱ri Buco u yaba Hwinsu nibui na soo nubui ka̠mu na ikanga nubui na a̠huru nubui na koce nubui ka̠mu.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Cina ci lagi: &lt;ka̱ri buna bu mayabuta na goo nga̠ goo bu ka̱ri icwa nubui.&gt; Aza umurni na inumu i hacobe ina i zake uniyo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Kwa walami wai icibago cikarigo ci Musa na hin, &lt;&lt;Bu zwama kamahinda,Walami.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Bu zwame na burya̠ ina goo bu hin Hwinsu iyuwa uikan aza ucagiya hwinsu kwa ubeya. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Ka̠ri Hwinsu kanmu na soo nubui, na idaku nubui, ka̠ri koce nobo, hinda ka̱ri buna bu mayabuta na nga̠ icwa nubui, u zake ka̠mu icubagu i haturare na ibacigago i hajumaga zwama sadaka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Nga̠ Yesu aba hyan bu cane na burya̠, kwa bware na hyan na boba, &lt;&lt;Bwa merenwa pa cigwama ci Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; Pani a hyakanuwo buna bu gope eaga bware makabo.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabo zwama Masihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yesu na cibaga na suwa yaba i ahunda a Hayahudawa, kwa bware na kabana ga, &lt;&lt;Neya hawalami hai cibago i Musa hab oga Kristi asa azwaga bugwama Dauda? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Dauda na icwa yaba, a nomage na koce a̠huru a burya̠ a Hwinsu, a hyin na Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu numui: &lt;&lt; &lt;Madale na wa u cuga numui kwa huna gya na san buna bubu wonje bubu kuzta.&gt;&gt; &gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Dauda na icwa yaba a oga bwa &lt;Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu.&gt; Neya buba bui san bwa bu buba?&gt;&gt; Aco na matanaga a kuli Bware a hoge laco hinda. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Na icibago, Yesu a zwama ga, &lt;&lt;Masikai ja na hawalami hai icibago i Musa. Asa aco na ka̱ri ibwadagano ha aco labe cilapo hinda a ka̱ri usanu wa aco aba matanaga na kasuwa, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />hinda a genbo a pan ga mudalo mu aco labe na suwa u muginga mu a̠hunda a Hayahudawa na mudalo mu labe na ihug an i lago. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Abe sa cage yaba na icwana i si'a sina sare siba kwadagi&gt; hinda sa zangacumi a̠hunda saba zwama aco hyan ga. Ai pana ga wahala dinya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadaka u bu'a buna bware buba kwaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu i madale na suwa ui yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa ihuga ina aba tagano sadaka hinda aba na gingyaga inga aco ba yiwa na tagana musare mu sadaka na suwa akwati. Aco na za izana a tane musare dinya. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Ama bu'a buna bware buba kwaji buna bu za ihya bu kore kwa na tana sinini sirya, sina si wucuwo kobo. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Kwa Yesu na oga silmajiri sa bware, kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na zwama, bu'a buna bware buba kwaji bu tane sadaka na ihuga ina aba tagano sadaka u buba u zake ka̠mu aco izana ina ka̠mu. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Ka̠mu waba a pan pa izana yaba ina aba za, ama buba, pa nagu u izana buba tane ka̠mu ina buba za.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Ihuzu i Iginga i ahunda a Hayahudawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />bYesu aba na sirwa pa yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa ilabe, kwa almajiri a Bware uikan na hyin na bware, &lt;&lt;Walami, Byana!&gt;&gt; Hatare ha labe hana! Na mu yaba mu gama muna!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Kwa Yesu na hin naba, &lt;&lt;I hyan ka̠mu mu yaba muna mu gama?&gt;&gt; Aza tare una aba ai curya zata na ucagiya; ai kwama han ka̠mu na cinge.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu kwa a madale zata wa a'ogo i'on i zaitun ina ima gingyage na yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa, kwa Bitrus, Yakub, Yohana na Andarawus na kabana Yesu na ciswin, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />&lt;&lt;Ci zwamanya, binba aba ai eaga ini? Hinda bai gaci ci hyan alama ci daki ini ka̱ri sinji?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu a hin naba: &lt;&lt;Masiki je bucohya buta ikulgana. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Aco dinya ai korya na iziya nimu, a hin , &lt;Asa gyamui,&gt; hinda ai kulgana aco dinya. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Hinda sa i hoge ijumu i gasa, ita hasinga hasoo aha̠hin. Zwama ini i pala, ama ihogu a sa korya̠. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Mu'ogo mui nyatan mucage mu'ogo na gasa, hinda cigwama ci nyatana ci cagiye gasa. I hoge ijumagu i cinge tihunba, na imerwa. Irwago i sungorwa bini. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />&lt;&lt;I masiki na sicwa asihin. Ai kulaga pa mugwamgwam hinda ai swantanga na suwa u yaba i ahunda a Hayahudawa. Zwama iziya nimui ai kula pa mugwamgwam zwama i cubage cikarigo ci laco ci Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Hinda mu'ogo ka̠mu mui hoge cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Sa i konbe ai kole pa mugwamgwam zwama ai ia̠gi shara'a, i ta ma dama ina ga̠hi i zwame. Zwama ina ya korya na suwa nubui, zwama sa gabuya bui ea cikarigo, ama a̠huru a burya̠ a Hwinsu abe a kargyago. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />&lt;&lt;Buhun bui cuta buhun zwama a hune bo, hinda buca bui cuta bwa bu buba zwama a hune bo. Saawo si a̠sengagya amace waba hal a sana a hune ga. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Aco ka̠mu ai wondaga zwama gya, ama buna bu yi hakuri hal korwa wai hogu ai cyagaga bo.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">sungoro u labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />&lt;&lt;I hyan i daba ina i kole u'o i yinsa ihuga ina ya sa iba-ka̠mu buna bu yiwa na karanta bu daki-aco na yiwa na Yahudiya a some kurwa ha'ogo. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Buna bu yiwa na zata u isuma i ukaba u buba buta kanzigya na ginbo izangu ihya. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Buna bu yiwa na inta hinda buta marengya buba na bu ginbo i zangi ukoshi u buba. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Si'a si mukabo na si'a si hyabo si sana i yama hun ni! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Ia̠je ahunda u sana hun habo, <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />hun uni aco ai so wahala una ai tabuwa ia̠ga tun irwago, ina i Hwinsu uba i doone, hal korwa baniya-aza eakana. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Sa Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu wa cakanu mohun, aza i hyan buco buna bui cyagaga. Ama yama ya aco na Hwinsu uba tanga, kwa uba na cakan mohun. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Na lokaci ani buna bu hyin na ga̠hi, &lt;Byana , Kristi bayo!&gt; ko, &lt;Byana, bware a buyo!&gt; ita yada. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Zwama Kristi a cibya na Acubago cibya ai sirya hinda ai eaga i mamaki zwama a inacume alagano-sa ui ma ea. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Zwama haruniyo ita malabta; na zwamano tibai ka̠mu hun ni.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">uringuwo u Bwa bu Buwoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />&lt;&lt;Ama na hun uni, ina i laga, &lt;&lt; &lt;hwinsu ui inci, hinda pyana uza i cingila; <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Ka̠mu muginga mu zaro mui hinage zata u zaro, hinda koce i majungtan.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />&lt;&lt;Na huni ai hyan Bwa bu Buwama na korwa zata u halalana koce u labe na izangacu. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Hinda Yesu ai cuma Acuma bware a tanaga alagano bware hasala ha nasi,ihogu u doone kurwa ihogu i zaro. <verse eid="MRK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />&lt;&lt;Baniya zanga u'on u muco nga̠ misali: sa u'on ui muco ha zwago i ibulage habonba, i daki habo u yabtano. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Harbuni hinda, sa hyan ini ya rwagwa, i daki zwama uni u yabutano, u yiwa na i'iba. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Kamahinda na zwama, aco azwaga azaa i kwadago kwa ka̠mu ini i ia̠gi. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Zaro na cinge ui ala ama cikarigo acimui ciza ala.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aza buna bu daki huna ko lokaci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Aza buna bu daki hwinsu ko lokaci, ko acuma Hwinsu na suwa zaro, ko Bwa bu Hwinsu, kwa di Buca̠ buba buba. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Ita labta! I sapule! Zwama ya dakuwo hun uni ko lokaci uba ui korya. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />U nya̠ga na buco bu cihano: sa bu ka̠ri kore cihano si bu curgagi agyama yaba i yan na wa u waba, tiganba na ibwana ina buba bui ia̠ga, bu zwama buna yiwa na i'iba bu a̠pa na burya̠. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Zwama haruni i hina na a̠pa zwama i dakuwo hun na buco bu yaba buba bui maringiya giwo-ko uyinbe, ko na usa u gita, ko na ubungwa mae'nta, ko na zibo u hwinsu. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Sa buca bu yaba bu gi, buta i bangya ga̠hin na malabo. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Ina gya na yiwa na zwamgana, si zwama tiganba: &lt;Masiki&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">A gami no zwama a hune Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />A gane muhun murya a ea lago ui kacigago i yaba na lago ui burodi una aba ai tanuwa yisti, alabe alabe na hawalami a icibago i umurnu i Musa a hina na ginbaga yina aba a kobe bware na ciswin zwama a hune Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Kwa aba na mazwamana, &lt;&lt;Ama sa hun lago uiyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Nga̠ Yesu aba na Betani, aba na ginbo i kore ire mare na yaba bu aba ogo Saminu ukuturu, kwa bu'a hya na korya na itako i manobe man ma za cada dinyiya, itako ini a eagyi e'ya na hatare ha gama. Bu'a buni bu kore kwa na pusi ikwalaba i manobe kwa na sukutag manobe mani kamshi na halana na icwa i Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Acagiya aco kwa aba na hacigaga suwa waba na yanse payi kwa aba na mazwaman, &lt;&lt;Bai sana aba hacigage manobe kamsi mayi haruna? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Sa a sange manobe ma ka̠mshi mani, moso u musare wai wuci ina aba ai cope i lebura musare mu ihurumu da̠ri u taco a pan aco nagu ui izana.&gt;&gt; Kwa aba na butan bo.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Kwa Yesu na hin na ba, &lt;&lt;Curya je bo,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Bai sa ga̠hi i butane inye? I na ia̠gi i burya̠. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Aco nagu ui izana a yiwa tare na ga̠hi tohunba, hinda ipwan i ia̠gya ga taimako hun ga̠hi ginbo. Ama iza na hyan hun ga̠hin ginbo. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Ina ia̠gi ina iba pwan. Ina hala manobe ka̠mshi na ikanga nimui kapi aba na wunbo. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Kamahinda na zwama, ka̠mu ihuga ina aba ai zwamaga cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu cina na doone, ina iba ia̠gi ai ia̠ga cikarigo ciba, na zwama a butaryagi ina buba ia̠.<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahuda u yaje a cuta Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Kwa Yahuda Iskariyoti, ina isa silmajiri ikope na sirya̠, na kore pa alabe alabe na ginbo i cuta ga bware zwama a kobe Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />A hoge laco nga̠ buba zwama ga haruni kwa na ia̠gya bware alkawali ai pan bware musare. Kwa bware na ginbaga ina i sana bu cuta Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a re mare mai ikacigago na silmajiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Hun jigu u lago Burodi aba ai tanuwa yisti, nga̠ usa gajo waba a bacige udwumaga zwama sadaka ui i kacigago, silmajiri si Yesu sa kabo bware, &lt;&lt;Honba goo bu ginbo ci kimga ihuga ina i goo bui re mare ma kacigago?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Kwa Yesu na cuman silmajiri sirya̠, kwa na hin na siba. &lt;&lt;Isa je na suwa ui i'ogo, i bangi buco na icwana i ukinbu u miya. I laga bo. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Kwa Yesu na hin na silmajiri si bware &lt;Ka̱mu yaba na buba es i kabo buco bu yaba, &lt;Walami u hyin: Hunba ukaba u hanyagata uba yiwa, i huga ina buba bui re mare ma lago ui kacigago na silmajiri a simui?&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Bui ciba ukaba u labe u zata, una aba kimga na hazonga. Kima̱gana apayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Kwa silmajiri na ala, kwa na bangi nga̱ Yesu aba zwama ga. Kwa siba na kimgana ihuga i re mare ma lago ui kacigago. <verse eid="MRK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Nga̱ uyinbe uba i, Yesu na silmajiri ikope na sirya̠. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Nga̱ aba na re mare na silmajiri, Yesu a hin naba, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na zwama,aza buna bui na cutan-buna bu gaci ciyiwa na re mare na buba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Nga̱ aba hugi cikarigo ci Yesu hasuwa ha silmajiri kwa na hacigaga,tiganba bu hina makabo ma Yesu,&lt;&lt;Ko gyamui?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Kwa Yesu a cane ga na hin, &lt;&lt;Buco buika̠ na suwa nuhin,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Buna bu yiwa na re mare na ikwano uika tare na gya. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Bwa bu Buwama bui kwaji nga̠ aba rubuci an bui kwaji. Ama yama pa buna bu ka̠ri cutan Bwa bu Hwinsu! Ui zakana sa macuwa bo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">ire i burodi na miya ma inabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Nga̠ aba na re mare, Yesu kwa na zangaci burodi, kwa na pan Hwinsu cilabe kwa na busaga, na pana silmajiri, bu hin, &lt;&lt;Ca je; usa ikanga numui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Kwa Yesu na zangaca adanda, na pana Hwinsu cilabe kwa na pan silmajiri, kwa aba na so kamu waba. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Kwa Yesu na hin, &lt;&lt;miya ma inabi mana ma nyaga na mahya amamui man ma kucuna mana aba i jiga zwama aco dinyiya a hyan icagagu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Kwa Yesu na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na zwama, naza i so miya ma inabi kwa hun na gya na so imata ipu i cigwama ci Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Nga̠ aba zuga hazuga ipanu Hwinsu cilabe, kwa aba na kure na hindana a'ogo i'on i zaitun.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus a cibe ai dakuwo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu a hin na silmajiri saba, &lt;&lt;Ka̠mu nuhin ai na suma i na curi gya&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Nga̠ aba rubuci aba rubuci na cikarigo ci Hwinsu: &lt;&lt; &lt;Na supi bu hubana bu hatami, hinda hatamai hai ma gatgaga.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Yesu a hin si na asingae pa aco na kwaju, na zulaga kuro Galili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Kwa Bitrus na cane Yesu, &lt;&lt;Sa aco ka̠mu i bu curya gya naza bale na bu curya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu a cane Bitrus, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda na bu zwama,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Nawuya na suwo u gita na kapin uka̠ri uga i ugano irya bui hyan ana bui na dakuwo hal izwamo itaco.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ama Bitrus a jidane na zwamage na koce, &lt;&lt;Ko u'o na kwaji tare na goo, na za i hin ana bu dakuwo.&gt;&gt; Kwa silmajiri ka̠mu na hin nga̠ Bitrus aba zwame.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a i ahunda na ihuga ina aba uge Gesamani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Kwa Yesu na silmajiri saba na kure ihuga ina aba ugo Getsemani, kwa Yesu na hin na silmajiri saba, &lt;&lt;Madale je apiyi gya na kuri apaya i a̠hunda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Kwa Yesu na zangi Bitrus, Yakub na Yohana Tare na buba, kwa suwa u bware na hacigaga hal iganga i bware i durr. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Kwa Yesu na hin naba, &lt;&lt;Soo nimui u hacigagi na cidama nga̠ na gimbo i kwaji.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Yisana je apiyi i iyi mugingo. <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Nga̠ Yesu aba ma danjigane cimu, kwa bware na kuzata na cinge kwa na ia̠ga ahunda na hin sa i ma ia̠ga a cyage bware wahala uni. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Kwa Yesu na hin, &lt;&lt;Abba, Buca,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Tibai ka̠mu i ma ea na goo. Zangaca adanda ana na icwa numui. Sa ina gya na gimbo, ama ina goo bu gimbo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Kwa Yesu na maringiya pa silmajiri sa bware na bangi sa na malabo. kwa Yesu na hin na Bitrus, &lt;&lt;Saminu&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Bu labucwa? Bui pwanuwa na madala i ea ape u awa uinka? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Kwa Yesu na hin naba &lt;&lt;Ea ape na a̠hunda zwama goo ta isa pa igwaju. Ahuru a yaje ama ikanga i za kuce.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Kwa Yesu na gupa ala na ia̠ ahunda bu zwamage ina aba zwamage na jigo. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Nga̠ bware buba gupe kure pa silmajiri, bu bangiga na malabo, zwama malabo ma ise haisa haba dinyiya. A nagi ina aba ai zwamana bware. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />U ringuwo u tacula, kwa Yesu na hin na ba, &lt;&lt;Ise yiwa na malabo na uhunpacu? U dwubo! Lokaci u kurwa. Byan, a cutana Bwa bu Buwama pa wa aco magwata̱. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Masinga! Ca ali! buna bui na cutana abuna bwa kurwa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">A kumbe Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesu aba na cikarigo, Yahuda, ina i yiwa tare na silmajiri ikupe na sirya, kwa na sire. aco na a yanse tare na bwre azase kasakari na sigungu, ana alabe alabe aba a cuma ga, na hawalami ha cikarigo ci Musa, na a'onga.<verse eid="MRK 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yahuda buna bu ka̠ri cutana Yesu bu zwama ga ina buba bui ea zwama a daki: &lt;&lt;Buna bu gya na maki; kumba bwa i ali na buba i a̠pa̠ bo. <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yahuda a halage i kure pa Yesu, kwa na hin &lt;&lt;Rabbi! Walami!&gt;&gt; Kwa na ciba Yesu maka̠la̠. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Kwa aco na a kure na Yahuda na kumbe Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Ama almajiri a Yesu ana a yanse ciyabu a zacigya kasakari kwa na gwabi bugyama bu bulabe bu yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa, na gunji cobe u buba <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu a hin naba, &lt;&lt;I sirya na kasakari na sigungu, na gimbo na kumba&gt;&gt; inga ni sa buhya? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Tuhun na yiwa na ga̠hi, na cibaga na yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa ama ina kumbuwa ama dole a sinji ina cikarigo ci Hwinsu cina acubagu Hwinsu aba zwamage ina i ia̠ga na gya. <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Hinda kwa silmajiri si bware na curya bware kwa na swame. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Aza bulagasa hya, bu za cilapo kwa iyape, bu yanse na lagana Yesu. Nga̠ aba kumbe bware, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />kwa buba na ia̠mana munda, kwa na kwamana hazunga ha buba na ala kasuju.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">A kule Yesu pa mugwamgwam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />A kule Yesu pa bulabe bu yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa, na alabe alabe ka̠mu, a'onga, na hawalami ha iciba i cikarigo ci Musa a kurya matanaga. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Bitrus a yanse na lagan ga cimire, na suwa u yaba bulabe bu yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa. bware bu madaliye na aco na ayiwa na a̠pe bware na hwabuta ula. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Alabe alabe na aco majalisa a yanse na ginbo ina ui sana sheda aba kumbe Yesu zwama a hune bware, ama a hinwo ko na ihya. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Aco dinyiya a kure azwama sheda a cibya zwama Yesu, ama cikarigo ci yaba ai yajuwo na ciba.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Acagiya aco kure kwa na zwamaga cibya ina Yesu ai iyiwo ama cikarigo ci waba ci sawa uinka̠; <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />&lt;&lt;Ci huge Yesu aba na zwamaga, &lt;Na hacigaga yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa ina aco aba ma na muhun mutaco hinda gya gupai ema ina i maiwa na muhun mutaco, ina sa buco bube bu ema.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Ko aba ma ai yajuwa na cikarigo ciba.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Kwa bulabe bu yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa na masiga kwa na ia̠gya Yesu makaba, &lt;&lt;Bu za i cyana? Bui huguwa ina aco na aba yiwa na zwamaga ana bu ia̠gi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ama Yesu a utani hinda ai cane ga. Hinda bulabe bu yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa jidani kabana Yesu, &lt;&lt;Gabuya busa Kristi, Bwa bu Hwinsu bu burya̠?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Gyamui&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Hinda i hyan Bwa bu Buwama bu madaliye na wa u cuga u Hwinsu na koce buba na kanzigya na halala zaro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Nga̠ bulabe bu yaba i ahunda a Hayahuawa buba huge ina Yesu iba hin kwa bulabe bu yaba ahunda a Hayahudawa ne hanje hazunga ha buba na dabe soo. &lt;&lt;Baisa ga̠hi gimbo i jidane hugi sheda hinda? bu hin. <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />&lt;&lt;I hugo i cwa i Hwinsu. Biya ga̠hi gimbo?&gt;&gt; ka̠mu waba a hyan ina bware buba ia̠ i jube a huni bware. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Hinda kwa acage aco hina na congana bware matambi; a kubta bware haisa, na supi bware na igucu, na hin, &lt;&lt;Ci zwamanya ina i ia̠ga wahyan!&gt;&gt; Aco na ayiwa na a̠pe a Yesu a zangi bware kwa na supi bware.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus a hin ana ai dakuwo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Bitrus aba na suwa u yaba bugwama bu labe, bugyama bu mukangaza mu bulabe bulabe bu ia̠ga pa Bitrus aba yiwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Nga̠ ikangaza iba hyan Bitrus na hwabuta ula, kwa iba na byana bware na burya̠, kwa iba na hin, &lt;&lt;Goo ma bu yiwa tare na Yesu i Nazaret.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Kwa Bitrus na sisana Yesu. Bitrus a cane, &lt;&lt;Ni dakuwo ina goo bu yiwa na ia̠ cikarigo ciba, kwa bware na sire i'iba i yaba. wa sanuwo kwa uka̠ri na uga <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Nga̠ bugyama bu ikangaza buba hyan bware payi, kwa buba na jidana kabana aco na yasinga payi, &lt;&lt;Buca buna bu yiwa tare na ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Kwa bware na jidana sisana ga. Ai sanuwo, aco na yasinga tare na Bitrus, &lt;&lt;Kamahinda bu yiwa tare na ba, zwama busa buco bu Galili.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Kwa bware na hinana na ma cwan hinda na matana uno u wo, kwa bware na macuna pa ba, &lt;&lt;Na dakuwo buco buna bu ga̠hi iyiwa na cikarigo ci buba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Ai sanuwo kwa uka̠ri na uga ia̠gi soo barya̠. Kwa Bitrus na mabutaryage cikarigo cina ci Yesu aba zwama bware; &lt;&lt;Kapin uka̠ri u uga bui hin ani bui na dakuwo hal izwamo itaco.&gt;&gt; Kwa Bitrus na tani cidaro.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">A kole Yesu pa Bilatus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Na ubungwa ma'enta, alabe alabe, na onga, na hawalami ha icibago i cikarigo ci musa na aco majalisa ma mugwamgwama ma Hayahudawa, a mapare muno. A pare Yesu, kwa na kola bware Bilatus. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Bilatus a kabo Yesu, &lt;&lt;Gabuya busa bugwama bu hayahudawa?&gt;&gt; Yesu a cane, &lt;&lt;Harbuni inga bu hin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Kwa alabe alabe na kole i dinya ana a hin bware i. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Kwa bilatus na gopa i kabana Yesu, &lt;&lt;Buza i cane?Bui hogowa i dinya ina aba yiwa na hin an bu ea. &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ama Yesu a cane bilatus na ihya, hal bilatus a hoge mamake.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">a gunji yesu hunkunci u'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Tuhumba uya u sa gajo u bugwama Hiridus hun lago ui i kacikago a curi buco buika buna aba pare aco aba ginbo. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Aza buco buna aba ogo Barabbas a pare bwa na ukaba u ci'incu zwama hun na aba i zanga hal a hune buco. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Aco na matanaga a kore kwa na kaban Bilatus a egyi ga ina boba sabe eagya ga hun lago. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Bilatus kwa na kaban ga, &lt;&lt;I ginbo ai curigagya bugwama bu hayahudawa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />bilatus a daki an zwama hasuwa ha siri aha alabe alabe ube usan aba kole Yesu pa bware. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ama alabe alabe kwa na amagan aco na matanaga an bilatus a curigagya ga Barabbas maimako u Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Bilatus kwa ne jidana i kabana aco na matanaga, &lt;&lt;Bai ganhi i ginbo gya eagyi, buna aba ogo bugwama bu Hayahudawa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Kwa aba na danda bicwaro, &lt;&lt;Jukai bware na; u'o masacu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Bilatus a kaba ga, &lt;&lt;Baiya? Imba eewo buba ?&gt;&gt; kwa aba na sana ci'ogo na koce, &lt;&lt;A jukai bware!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Zwama Bilatus a ginbo i sana hasoo ha aco na matanaga ha cine, Bilatus kwa na curigagya ga Barabbas. Kwa bware na san swace Yesu, kwa cutan Yesu azwama a jukai bware zata u; u'on.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musoja mu ha Romawa a eagyi Yesu alala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Musoja kwa na kore na Yesu suwa u pada i muba kwa na oga musoja mu bariki. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Kwa aba na bwadan Yesu cilapo cina ci nyaga na ci mugwamgwam ci kala u wuya, kwa aba hinda na pyace naji kware tana bware na icwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Kwa aba na hinana i sangana Yesu, &lt;&lt;Sana je, bugwama bu hayahudawa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Kwa aba na hinana i supaga Yesu na icwa na agungu na cwangana hatanbi. Kwa aba kwanda na kuzat an a yiwa na pan bware cilabe. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Nga̠ aba hogi i same bware, kwa aba na bwajiga bware cilapo cina aba bwada bware kala u wuya kwa na ringya i bwadan bo cina ci buba. Kwa aba na kola bware ihuga ina aba ai jukai bware na u'on u masacu.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">A jukai Yesu na u'on u masacu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Aba na cihano kwa aba na bangi buco bu i'ogo Sayirin, iziya i buba Saminu, buca bu Alekzanda na Rufus, buba na ginbo koro hilo, kwa musoja na sana bware bu zangi u'on masacu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />A kole Yesu ihuga ina aba ogo Golgota (I huga akuku ai icwa). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Kwa aba na pa Yesu miya ma inabi aba hitagi na masa, ama bo wonje i so. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Kwa aba na jukai bware na u'on masacu. Kwa aba hinda na mahabusaga hazunga ha bware, kwa aba na mabyana inga tiganba hyan habe u buba. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />A jukai Yesu karfe utanasi u bungwa aba jukai bware. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Na zata u'on una aba jukai Yesu a i rubutu una usa ina aba zargi bware:&lt;&lt;BUGWAMA BU HAYAHUDAWA.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />A jukai ahya barya tare na Yesu, buika na wa u cuga bucage na wa u gula. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Uni usa isinju i cizwamago ca acubago a Hwinsu cina ci hin, &lt;&lt;A tanani bware pa aco magwata̠.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Aco na yiwa na lagana yina ana aba jukai Yesu a hina na eagya bware cikarigo ci maya, na jugutan sicwa saba na hin, &lt;&lt;Aha! go buna bu hin an bui huzi Iginga i hunda a Hayahudawa hinda goo gope ima na mohun mutaco, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />kanzigya zata u'on masacu ma cyagaga icwa nubui!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Harbuni hinda alabe alabe na hawalami ha cikarigo ci Musa a eagyi Yesu alala. Kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Bware bu cyagage cagiyaco,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ama bui pwanuwa na caga icwa i buba! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Curya kristi na, bugwama bu Isra'ila, bu kanzigya zata u u'on masacu, nga gaci ci hyan ci yaje.&gt;&gt; Ahya na aba jukai ga tare na bware a eagyi bware cikarigo ci siri.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">U'o u Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Na hwinsu na icwa kwa ihuga na inci hal kurwa u yinbe. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Na karfe ataco kwa Yesu na sana cu'ogo na hin, &lt;&lt;Eloi, Eloi, lama sabatani?&gt;&gt; Wata, &lt;&lt;Hwinsu numui, Hwinsu numui, bai san go na curi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Aco na yinsinga ciyabu inga aba hoge, kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Kubla je, bware bu yiwa na oge Iliya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Kwa buco buika na yamana monda, na cwape usoso na miya ma sogore ma saawo sa inabi, kwa na cubi na agungu, kwa na pana Yesu ana a so. &lt;&lt;Baniya curya ci hyan bware. Curya ci hyan ko Acubago Iliya ai kore a cage bware a kanzigiyo bo,&gt;&gt; bu hin. <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Kwa Yesu na sana cu'ogo,kwa aba na hundana muhunjo mu kundata kwa na kwaji. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Kwa ulapo u Iginga i ahunda a Hayahudawa na mahanda cirya ina konbe zata koro u cinge. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Nga̠ ko na ihya isoja i labe i Roma, ina i yiwa anpe ciyabu na Yesu, iba hoge cu'og ci Yesu na inga aba kwaji, kwa iba na hin,&gt;&gt; Kamahinda buco buna bu sa bwa bu Hwinsu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Si'a sina si yanse na lagana ga cimere siba na byangana. Haziya ha siba Imaryamu i Magadala, Imaryamu amaci a Yakub inoya na Yusuf, na hinda Isalomi. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Tun na Galili si'a sina siba sa laga yesu siba na eagya Bware ina buba ginbo.Sicyagiya si'a hinda sa yanse dinya sina sa laga Bware na Urshalima sa yanse payi.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwunbanu i Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Nga̠ uyinbe uba i, aba na ikimugano (wata, kapi hun Asabar). <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Kwa buciyahya buna aba ogo Yusuf i Arimatiya na kore, iba ma isa bu majalisa, i yanse na anpe hun cigwama ci Hwinsu, kwa bware na koce u suwa na koro pa Bilatus na kabana a pan bware ikanga i Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Bilatus a hoge mamaki an Yesu a rigyano a kwajo. Kwa bware na o'ga isoja i labe bu hoge ko kamahinda Yesu a kwajo. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Nga̠ bware buba hoge harbuni isoja i labe kwa bware na pana Yusuf ikanga i Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Kwa yusuf na sa ulapo u wumbanu, kwa na kanzigi ikanga i Yesu, kwa na nadaga na ulapo u cine, kwa na iri na izin ina aba sabe ugandaro. Hinda kwa na gandale tare na i'eba i izin na gondana. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Imaryamu i Magadala amaci a Yusuf a hyan ka̠mu ihuga ina aba labute ikanga i Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Wansengewa u Yesu pa aco a kwajo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Nga̠ hun ihupacu i Hayahudawa uba ali, Imaryamu i Magadala, na Imaryamu amaci a Yakub, na Isalomi a san icwana i kamshi zwama a sukutage ikanga i Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Hun u jigo u sati, na ubongo mae'nta na isiro i hwisu, si'a siba na yina u korwa pa izin <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />siba na yina kwa siba na makaban, &lt;&lt;Ganba bui ci ginbulo utare pa i'eba i izin?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ama nga̠ siba byane zata, kwa siba na hyan tare una usa ulabe, bucohya bu gandalo on. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Nga̠ aba ese na suwa izin kwa aba na hyan buco na hazunga ha cene bu madale na wa ucuga, hinda a hoge iwasa. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Kwa buco bu hazunga ha cine na hyin naba, &lt;&lt;Ita hoga iwasa.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;I yiwa na ginbo Yesu i Nazaret, ana aba jukai zata u'on u masacu. Bware bu masingo! Bware bu za piniya. Byana je ihuga ina aba labute Bware. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Ama ala je, i zwama silmajiri si bware na Bitrus, &lt;Bware bui i zwalag korwo u Galili. Ahwayi ganhi i hyan Bware, nga̠ Bware buba bui zwama.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Harbuni hinda na cidagaro ci ikanga na mamaki, si'a sa sere na suwa ui izin na monda. Ai zwamanuwa bucohya ihya, zwama sa hoge iwasa.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a cibe icwa yaba pa maryamu ana a sire magadali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Nga Yesu aba masenge na, ma'inta hun lahadi hun u jigo un sati bu rwage i silta Imaryamu i Magadala, pa si'a sina si Yesu aba hangage na mupyala mu eewo utandarya. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />I kore kwa na zwaman aco na yanse tare na Yesu ana yanse na ihacigago i suwa cidaro. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Nga̠ aba hoge na Yesu a yiwa ai kwajuwo hinda i hyan bware, ai yajuwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Bayan uni Yesu a masake inyaganu yaba kwa buba na ma ciba pa silmajiri sirya siba na cihano kurwa u hilo. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Silmajiri sini sirya si zwama si cage ama si yadwo na cikarigo ciniyo. <verse eid="MRK 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Nai ihogu Yesu a kore a macibe icwa yaba pa silmajiri ikope na ikan siba na re mare; Bware bu butaga ga zwama nagu u itano soo waba na nagu we yadwo na aco a hyan bware an bu masingo. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Kwa Yesu na hin na hin na silmajiri sa bware kupe na uika̠, &lt;&lt;Esa je doone i ia̠gi aco ka̠mu cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Buna bu yaje a eagyi bo baptisma bui hyan ucyago, ama buna bui yadwuwa bui kwaji. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Hinda alama na ai lagana Aco na aba ai eaga bina zwama a yaje: na iziya numui ai ance mupyala mu eewo; ai kargyaga na sire si menwa; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />ai konbe sihwa na wa waba; hinda sa so magari, maza eagya ga ihya; ai cukana wa waba pa aco na ai kogowa laco hinda mahuna mai curya ga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">A zangi Yesu kurwo zaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Nga̠ Bugwama bu doone Yesu aba hogi eagya ga cikarigo cini, kwa na zangaco bware koro u zaro bu madale na wa u cuga u Hwinsu. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Silmajiri si sere kwa na zwamaga cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu tuhunba, hinda Bugwama bu doone Hwinsu u yanse tare naba hinda u cibe cikarigo cuba cisa kamahinda pa i mamaki ina aba ia̠gi.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>